hadiths[286]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3673","Mamar ne hamein ibne-Taaus se khabar di, unhon-ne apne walid ( Taaus-bin-kaisaan ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke ahad mein aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat ke) shuruati ( do saalon tak ( ikatthi ( teen talaaqein aik shumaar hoti thi. phir Hazrat Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : logon ne aisey kaam mein jald bazi shuru kar di hai jis mein unke liye tahammul aur soch vichaar ( zaroori ( tha. agar ham is (jaldi) ko un par Nafiz kar dein (to shayad wo tahammul se kaam lena shuru kar dein ). iske baad unhon-ne isey un par Nafiz kar diya. (ikatthi teen talaaqon ko teen shumaar karne lagey.)"
"3674","ibne-Juraij ne hamein khabar di, kaha : mujhey ibne-Taaus ne apne walid ( Taaus-bin-kaisaan ( se khabar di ke abu-Sahbaa ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : kya aap jantey hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke ahad mein, aur Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat ke) shuruati ( teen saalon tak teen talaaqon ko aik shumaar kiya jata hai? to Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya : haan."
"3675","Ibrahim-bin-Maisra ne Taaus se riwayat ki ke abu-Sahbaa ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : aap apne nawaadir qimtee (jin se aksar log be-khabar hain) fatwon mein se koi cheez inayat karein. kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke ahad mein teen talaaqein aik nahi thin? unhon-ne jawab diya : yaqinan aisey hi tha, iske baad jab Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka zamana aaya to logon ne pai-dar-pai (ghalat tareeqey se aik sath teen) talaaqein dena shuru kar dein. to unhon-ne is baat ko un par laagu kar diya."
"3676","Hisham , yani dustwaai ( kapdey waale) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Yahya-bin-Kasir ne Yala-bin-Hakim se hadis bayan kartey huey likh bheja, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Jubair se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, wo ( biwi ko apne uper ( haram karne ke barey mein kaha kartey they : ye qism hai jiska wo kaffara dega aur Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : yaqinan tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki zindagi ( mein behtreen namoona hai."
"3677","Muawiya-bin-Salaam ne hamein Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir se hadis bayan ki ke Yala-bin-Hakim ne unhein khabar di, unhein Saeed-bin-Jubair ne khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna : unhon-ne kaha : jab koi aadmi apni biwi ko apne uper haram thehra ley to ye qism hai jiska wo kaffara dega, aur kaha : bila shubah tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki zindagi ( mein behtreen namoona hai."
"3678","Ubaid-bin-Umair ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se suna, wo bata rahi thin ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zainab-binte ( Jahash ( (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan thahartey aur unke paas se shehad nosh farmatey they : kaha : main aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne ittifaq kiya ke ham mein se jiske paas bhi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (pahley ( tashrif laaein, wo kahey : mujhey aap se maghaafeer ki bo mehsus ho rahi hai. kya aap ne maghaafeer khaai hai? aap unmein se aik ke paas tashrif le gaey to unhon-ne aap ke samney yahi baat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : balke maine Zainab-bint-Jahash ke yahan se shehad piyaa hai. aur aainda hargiz nahi piyun ga . is par) Quraan ( nazil hua :'' aap kyon haram thehratey hain jo Allah ne aap ke liye halal kiya hai?'' us farman tak : agar tum donon tauba karo. padhi. ye Aaisha aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke liye kaha gaya. padhi. aur jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni kisi biwi se raaz ki baat kahi us se murad (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye farman ( hai : balke maine shehad piyaa hai."
"3679","abu-Usama ne hamein Hisham se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid ( Urwa ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) meethi cheez aur shehad ko pasand farmatey they, jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Asr ki Namaz padhtey to apni tamam beeviyon ke yahan chakkar lagaatey aur unke qareeb hotey , ( aisa hua ke) aap Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan gaey to unke yahan aap us se zyada ( der ke liye) rukey jitna aap ( kisi biwi ke paas ( ruka kartey they. un (Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ( ko unke khandan ki kisi aurat ne shehad ka ( bharaa hua) aik bartan hadiya kya tha to unhon-ne usmein se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko shehad pilaya . maine (dil mein) kaha : Allah ki qism ! ham aap (ko zyada der qiyam se rokney (ke liye zaroor koi heela karengi, chunanche maine is baat ka zikr Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) se kya, aur kaha : jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumharey yahan tashrif laaengey to tumharey qareeb hongey, (is waqt) tum unse kehna : Allah ke rasool! kya aap ne maghaafeer khaai hai? wo tumhen jawab dengey, nahi ! to tum unse kehna : ye bo kaisi hai? . padhi. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ye baat intihai nagawar guzarti thi ke aap se bo mehsus ki jaey. padhi. is par wo tumhen jawab dengey : mujhey Hafsa ne shehad pilaya tha, to tum unse kehna ( phir ( uski makkhi ne arfat ( boti) ka ras choosa hoga. mein bhi aap se yahi baat kahungi aur Safiya tum bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi kehna ! jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan tashrif le gaey, ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : Sauda (Raziallahu anha) kehti hain is zaat ki qism jiske siwa koi haqiqi maabood nahi ! aap abhi darwazey par hi they ke main tumhari malaamat ke dar se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko buland awaz se wo baat kehney hi lagi thi jo tum ne mujh se kahi thi, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qareeb huey to Hazrat Sauda (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! kya aap ne maghaafeer khaai hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi. unhon-ne kaha : to ye bo kaisi hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : mujhey Hafsa ne shehad pilaya tha. unhon-ne kaha : phir uski makkhi ne arfat ka ras choosa hoga. iske baad jab aap mere yahan tashrif laaey, to maine bhi aap se yahi baat kahi, phir aap Hazrat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaey, to unhon-ne bhi yahi baat kahi, iske baad aap Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan (dobara) tashrif laey to unhon-ne kaha : kya aapko shehad pesh na karun to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi, mujhey uski zarurat nahi. (Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : Sauda (Raziallahu anha) kehney lagin, Subhan-Allah! Allah ki qasam! ham ne aapko us se mahroom kar diya hai. to maine unse kaha : khamosh rahen. Abu-Ishaq Ibrahim ne kaha : hamein Hasan-bin-Bishr bin-Qasim ne hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein abu-Usama ne bilkul isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"3680","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se isi sanad ke sath usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"3681","ibne-Shahab se riwayat hai, kaha : mujhey abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne khabar di ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya ke wo apni beeviyon ko ikhtiyar dein to aap ne ( uski ( shuruaat mujh se ki, aur farmaya : main tum se aik baat karne laga hun. tumharey liye is baat mein koi harj nahi ke tum apne waalidain se mashwara karne tak ( jawab diye mein) ujlat se kaam na lo. unhon-ne kaha : aapko b-khoobi ilm tha ke mere waalidain mujhey kabhi aap se juda honey ka mashwara nahi dengey. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bila shubah Allah Taala ne farmaya hai : aey Nabi ! apni beeviyon se keh dijiye ki agar tum duniya ki zindagi aur uski zeenat chahti ho to aao main tumhen ( duniya ka ( saaz w saman dun aur tumhen achai ke sath rukhsat kar dun aur agar tum Allah aur uska rasool aur aakhirat ka ghar chahti ho to Allah ne tum mein se nek kaam karne waaliyon ke liye ajr azeem taiyaar kar rakha hai. ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : maine kaha : unmein se kis baat main apne waalidain se mashwara karun? main to Allah, uska rasool aur aakhirat ka ghar chahti hun. kaha : phir Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tamam beeviyon ne wahi kya jo maine kya tha."
"3682","Ibad bin Ibad ne hamein Aasim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muaz adwiya se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab ham mein se kisi biwi ki baari ka din hota to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( kisi aur biwi ke yahan janey ke liye) ham se ijazat letey they, halanke ye aayat nazil ho chuki thi : aap unmein se jisey chaahein (khud se) alag rakhein aur jisey chaahein apne paas jagah dein. to Muaza ne unse puchha : jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aap se ijazat letey to aap unse kya kehti thin? unhon-ne jawab diya : main kehti thi : agar ye ( ikhtiyar ( mere sipurd hai to main apne aap par kisi ko tarjeeh nahi deti ."
"3683","( Abdullah ( bin-Mubarak ne kaha : hamein Aasim ne isi sanad se usi ke ham-mana khabar di."
"3684","Absar ne hamein Ismail bin abi Khalid se khabar di, unhon-ne Shabi se aur unhon-ne Masruq se riwayat ki, kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : (jab) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein (alehda ho janey ka ( ikhtiyar diya tha, to ham ne usey talaaq shumar nahi kya."
"3685","Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne isi sanad ke sath Masruq se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab meri ahliya ne mujhey pasand kar liya to iske baad mujhey koi parwah nahi ke main usey aik baar, so baar ya aik hazaar bar ikhtiyar dun. bila shubah maine Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se malum kya tha to unhon-ne jawab diya : bila shubah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ikhtiyar diya tha to kya wo talaaq thi! ( nahi thi.)"
"3686","Shoba ne hamein Aasim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Shabi se, unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko (sath rehney ya alehda ho janey ka ( ikhtiyar diya tha aur wo talaaq nahi thi."
"3687","Sufiyan ne Aasim Ahwal aur Ismail bin abi Khalid se, unhon-ne Shabi se, unhon-ne Masruq se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ikhtiyar diya to ham ne aapko ikhtiyar kya (chun liya) aur aap ne usey talaaq shumar nahi kya."
"3688","abu-Muawia ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Muslim se, unhon-ne Masruq se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ikhtiyar diya to ham ne aapko ikhtiyar kar liya aur aap ne usey ham par (talaaq wghaira) kuchh shumar nahi kya."
"3689","Ismail bin Zakariya ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Aamash ne Ibrahim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aswad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, (neez Ismail ne) Aamash se, unhon-ne Muslim (ibne-sabeeh) se, unhon-ne Masruq se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se isi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3690","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aaey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir honey ki ijazat maang rahe they. unhon-ne logon ko aap ke darwazey par baithey huey paya. unmein se kisi ko ijazat nahi mili thi. kaha : Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ijazat mili to wo andar dakhil ho gaey, phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) aaey, unhon-ne ijazat mangi, unhein bhi ijazat mil gaee, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ghamgeen aur khamosh baithey huey paya, aap ki beeviyan aap ke ird-gird thin. kaha : to unhon (Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : main zaroor koi aisi baat karunga jis se main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hansaaunga. unhon-ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! kash! ke aap binte- khaarija ko dekhtey jab us ne mujh se nafqa ka sawal kya to main uski taraf badha aur uski gardan daba di. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans padey aur farmaya : ye bhi mere ird-gird baithi hain, jaisey tum dekh rahe ho, aur mujh se nafqa maang rahi hain. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf uthey aur unki gardan par zarb lagana chahtey they aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf badhey aur wo unki gardan par maarna chahtey they, ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon ko us se rok diya. musnad Ahmed : 3/328) aur donon keh rahe they : tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us cheez ka sawal karti ho jo unke paas nahi hai. wo kehney lagin : Allah ki qasam! aaj ke baad ham kabhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisi cheez ka mutalba nahi karengi jo aap ke paas na hogi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik maah ya untees din tak ke liye unse alehadgi ikhtiyar kar li. phir aap par ye aayat nazil hui : aey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! aap apni beeviyon se keh do. yahan tak ke yahan pahunch gaey : tum mein se neki karne waliyon ke liye bada ajr hai. (Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : aap ne shuruat Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ki aur farmaya : aey Aaisha ! main tumharey samney aik mamla pesh kar raha hun aur pasand karta hun ke tum, apne waalidain se mashwara kar leney tak usmein jaldi na karna. unhon-ne kaha : kya main aap ke barey mein, Allah ke rasool! apne waalidain se mashwara karungi! balke main to Allah , iske rasool aur aakhirat ke ghar ko chunti hun, aur aap se ye darkhast karti hun ke jo maine kaha hai, aap apni beeviyon mein se kisi ko uski khabar na dein. aap ne farmaya : mujh se jo bhi poochhegi main usey bata dunga, Allah Taala ne mujhey sakhti karne wala aur logon ke liye mushkilat dhoondney wala bana kar nahi bheja, balke Allah ne mujhey taleem dene wala aur aasani karne wala bana kar bheja hai."
"3691","Samak abu-Zameel se riwayat hai, ( unhon-ne kaha : ( mujhey Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( mujhey umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon se alehadgi ikhtiyar farmai, kaha : main masjid mein dakhil hua to logon ko dekha wo (pareshani aur tafakkur mein) kankariyan zamin par mar rahe hain, aur keh rahe hain : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai, ye waqia unhein pardey ka hukm diye janey se pahley ka hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine (dil mein) kaha : aaj main us mamley ko jaan kar rahunga. unhon-ne kaha : main Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas gaya, aur kaha : Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki beti! tum us had tak pahunch chuki ho ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko azeeyat do? unhon-ne jawab diya : Khattab ke betey ! aap ka mujh se kya waasta? aap apni gathri (ya thaila wghaira jis mein qeemti saaz w saman sanbhaal kar rakha jata hai yani apni beti Hafsa (Raziallahu anha)) ki fikr karein. unhon-ne kaha : phir main (apni beti) Hafsa binte-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur kaha : Hafsa! kya tum us had tak pahunch gaee ho ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko takleef do? Allah ki qasam! tumhen khub malum hai ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tum se mohabbat nahi rakhtey. agar main na hota to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhen talaaq de detey. ( meri ye baat sun kar) wo buri tarah se roney lagin. maine unse puchha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kahan hain? unhon-ne jawab diya : wo apne baala khaney par saman rakhney wali jagah mein hain. main wahan gaya to dekha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ghulam Rabaah (Raziallahu anhu) chaubaarey ki chaukhat ke nichey wali lakdi par betha hai. us ne apne donon paon lakdi ki suraakh daar seedhi par latka rakhey hain. wo khajoor ka aik tanaa tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par) qadam rakh kar) chadhtey aur utartey they. maine awaz di, Ribah ! mujhey apne paas, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein, hazir honey ki ijazat ley do. Ribah (Raziallahu anhu) ne bula khaney ki taraf nazar ki, phir mujhey dekha aur kuchh na kaha, maine phir kaha : Ribah ! mujhey apne paas , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein, hazir honey ki ijazat ley do, Ribah (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( dobara ( bula khaney ki taraf nigaah uthai , phir mujhey dekha, aur kuchh na kaha, phir maine apni awaz buland ki aur kaha : aey Ribah ! mujhey apne paas, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein, hazir honey ki ijazat ley do, mera khayal hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne samjha hai ke main Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ki (sifarish karne ki) khaatir aaya hun, Allah ki qism ! agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey uski gardan udaaney ka hukm dein to main uski gardan uda doonga, aur maine apni awaz ko) khub ( buland kya, to usne mujhey ishara kya ke uper chadh aao. main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aap aik chataai par letey huey they, main baith gaya, aap ne apna izaar durust kya aur aap (ke jism) par iske ilawa aur kuchh na tha aur chataai ne aap ke jism par nishan daal diye they. maine apni aankhon se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke saman ke kamrey mein dekha to sirf muththi bhar jo aik saa ke barabar hongey, jau aur kamrey ke aik koney mein itni hi keekar ki chhaal dekhi. iske ilawa aik ghair dabaghat shuda chamda latkaa hua tha. kaha : to meri aankhen beh padin, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : ibne-khattaab! tumhen kya cheez rula rahi hai? maine kaha : Allah ke Nabi ! main kyon na roon? us chataai ne aap ke jism At-har par nishan daal diye hain, aur ye aapka saman rakhney ka kamra hai, usmein wahi kuchh hai jo mujhey nazar aa raha hai, aur qaisar w Kisraa nehron aur phalon ke darmyan (shaandaar zindagi Basar kar rahe) hain, jabke aap to Allah ke rasool aur uski chuni hui hasti hain, aur ye aap ka Sara saman hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ibne-khattaab ! kya tumhen pasand nahi ke hamarey liye aakhirat ho aur unke liye duniya ho? maine kaha : kyon nahi ! kaha : jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua tha to aapkey chehrey par ghussa dekh raha tha, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! aapko (apni ( beeviyon ki haalat ki bina par kya dushwari hai? agar aap ne unhein talaaq de di hai to Allah aap ke sath hai, uske Farishtey, Jibreel, Mikaail, main, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aur tamam momin aap ke sath hain. aur main Allah ka shukr ada karta hun ke maine kam hi koi baat kahi , magar maine ummeed ki ke Allah meri is baat ki tasdeeq farma dega jo main keh raha hun. ( chunanche aisey hi hua) aur ye takhyeer ki aayat nazil ho gaee : agar wo (Nabi ( tum sab ( beeviyon ( ko talaaq de dein to qareeb hai ke unka rab , unhein tum se behtar beeviyan badley mein de. aur agar tum donon unke khilaf aik doosrey ki madad karogi, to Allah khud unka nigahban hai, aur Jibreel aur Saleh momin aur uske baad tamam Farishtey (unke) madadgar hain. Aaisha binte- abi-Bakr aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anhunna) donon Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tamam beeviyon ke muqaabley mein aik doosrey ka sath deti thin. maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! kya aap ne unko talaaq de di hai? aap ne farmaya : nahi. maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! main masjid mein dakhil hua tha to log kankariyan zamin par mar rahe they, aur keh rahe they : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai. kya main utar kar unhein bata dun ke aap ne un ( beeviyon ( ko talaaq nahi di? aap ne farmaya : haan, agar chaho. main musalsal aap se guftgu karta raha yahan tak ke aap ke chehrey se ghussa door ho gaya, aur yahan tak ke aap ke hont khuley aur aap hansey. aap ke samney waley daant sab insanon se zyada khoobsurat they. phir Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (bala khaney se nichey) utrey. main taney ko thaamtey huey utra aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisey utrey jaisey zamin par chal rahe hon, aap ne taney ko hath tak na lagaya . maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! aap bula khaney mein 29 din rahe hain. aap ne farmaya : mahina 29 din ka hota hai. chunanche main masjid ke darwazey par khada hua, aur buland awaz se pukar kar kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq nahi di, aur) phir ( ye aayat nazil hui : aur jab unke paas amn ya khof ki koi khabar aati hai to usey mashhoor kar detey hain, aur agar wo usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf aur apne maamlaat sanbhalney walon ki taraf lota detey, to wo log jo unmein usse asl matlab akhaz kartey hain usey zaroor jaan letey. to main hi tha jisne us mamley ki asl haqiqat ko akhaz kya, aur Allah Taala ne takhyeer ki aayat nazil farmai."
"3692","Sulaiman-bin Bilal ne kaha : mujhey Yahya ne Ubaid bin Hunain se khabar di ke unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne kaha : maine saal bhar intizar kya, main Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aayat ke barey mein malum karna chahta tha magar unki haibat ki wjah se unse sawal karne ki himmat na paata tha, yahan tak ke wo Haj karne ke liye rawana huey, main bhi unke sath nikla, jab lautey to ham rastey mein kisi jagah they ke wo qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye peelu ke darakht ki taraf chaley gaey, main unke intizar mein thehar gaya, yahan tak ke wo farigh ho gaey, phir main unke sath chal padaa, maine kaha : ameerul-momeneen ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se wo kon si 2 khawateen thin jinhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khilaf ekaa kar liya tha? unhon-ne jawab diya : wo Hafsa aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) thin. maine kaha : Allah ki qism ! main aik saal se iske barey mein aap se poochhna chahta tha magar aap ke raub ki wjah se himmat na paata tha. unhon-ne kaha : aisa nahi karna, jo baat bhi tum samjho ke mujhey ilm hai, iske barey mein mujh se poochh liya karo, agar main janta hua to tumhen bata doonga . kaha : aur Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! jab ham jahiliyat ke zamaney mein they, to aurton ko kisi shumaar mein na rakhtey they, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne unke barey mein jo nazil kya, so nazil kya, aur jo (martaba) unhein dena tha so diya. unhon-ne kaha : aik martaba main kisi mamley mein laga hua tha, iske mutaalliq soch bichaar kar raha tha ke mujhey meri biwi ne kaha : agar aap aisa aisa kar lein (to behtar hoga.) maine usey jawab diya : tumhen us se kya sarokaar? aur yahan (is mamley mein) tumhen kya dilchaspi hai? aur aik kaam jo main karna chahta hun usmein tumhara takalluf (zabardasti taang adaana) kaisa? usne mujhey jawab diya : ibne-khattaab! aap par tajjub hai ! aap ye nahi chahtey ke aap ke aagey baat ki jaey, jabke aap ki beti Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisey palat kar jawab deti hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) din bhar us se naraz rahtey hain. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main (usi waqt) apni chadar pakadta hun aur apni jagah se nikal khada hota hun, yahan tak ke Hafsa ke paas pahunchta hun. ja kar maine us se kaha : bitiya! tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisey jawab deti ho ke wo Sara din naraz rehtey hain. Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne jawab diya : Allah ki qasam! ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jawab de leti hain. maine kaha : jaan lo main tumhen Allah ki saza aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki narazgi se dara raha hun, meri beti ! tumhen wo ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) apne rawaiye ki bina par) dhokey mein na daal de jisey apne husn aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki apne se mohabbat par naaz hai. phir main nikla yahan tak ke Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan aaya, kyonke meri unse qarabat dari thi. maine unse baat ki to Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne mujhey jawab diya : ibne-khattaab tum par tajjub hai ! tum har kaam mein dakhal andazi kartey ho yahan tak ke tum chahtey ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur unki beeviyon ke beech bhi dakhal do? unhon-ne mujhey is tarah aadey hathon liya ke jo ( azm ( main (dil mein) pa raha tha (ke mein paak beeviyon ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney jawab deney se rok loonga ( mujhey tod kar us se alag kar diya. chunanche main unke yahan se nikal aaya. mera aik Ansari sathi tha, jab main (aap ki majlis se) ghair hazir hota to wo mere paas ( wahan ki) khabar laata aur jab wo ghair hazir hota to main uske paas khabar ley aata. ham us zamaney mein ghassan ke badshahon mein se aik badshah se dar rahe they. hamein bataya gaya tha ke wo ham par chadhai karna chahtey hain. us (ki wjah ( se hamarey seeney ( andeshon se) bharey huey they. ( achcha aik din) mera Ansari dost aa kar darwaza khatkhataney laga aur kehney laga : kholo , kholo ! maine puchha : ghassani aa gaya hai? usne kaha is se bhi zyada sangeen mamla hai, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon se alehadgi ikhtiyar kar li hai. maine kaha : Hafsa aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki naak khaak aalud ho! phir main apne kapdey lekar nikal khada hua, yahan tak ke) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein) hazir hua. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne bula khaney mein they jis par seedhi ke zariey chadh kar jana hota tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka aik siyah faam ghulam seedhi ke sirey par betha hua tha. maine kaha : ye umr hai) khidmat mein haziri ki ijazat chahta hai) , to mujhey ijazat ata hui. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney ye saari baat bayan ki, jab main Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki baat par pahuncha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskura diye. aap aik chataai par) letey huey) they, aap ke) jism Mubarak (aur us ( chataai) ke darmyan kuchh na tha. aap ke sar ke nichey chamdey ka aik takiya tha jis mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi. aap ke paon ke qareeb keekar ki chhaal ka chhota sa gatha padaa tha aur aap ke sar ke qareeb kuchh kachchey chamdey latkey huey they. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke pahlu par chataai ke nishan dekhey to ro padaa. aap ne puchha : tumhen kya rulaa raha hai? kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! Kisraa aur qaisar donon (kufr ke bawajood) us naaz w nemat mein hain jis mein hain aur aap to Allah ke rasool hain? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya tumhen pasand nahi ke unke liye ( sirf ( duniya ho aur tumharey liye aakhirat ho?"
"3693","Hammaad-bin-Salma ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Ubaid bin Hunain se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : main Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath ( Haj se) wapas aaya yahan tak ke jab ham marruz-zohran mein they. aagey Sulaiman-bin Bilal ki hadis ki tarah poori lambi hadis bayan ki, magar unhon (ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : maine kaha : 2 aurton ka mamla kya tha? unhon-ne jawab diya : (wo ( Hafsa aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anhunna) ( thin) aur is mein ye izafa kya : main (pak beeviyon ke) hujron ke paas aaya to har ghar mein roney ki awaz thi, aur ye bhi izafa kya : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse aik maah ela kya tha, jab 29 din huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( bula khaney se) utar kar unke paas tashrif ley aaey."
"3694","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ubaid bin Hunain se suna, wo Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam they. unhon-ne kaha : maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : main Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se un 2 aurton ke barey mein poochhna chahta tha jinhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein ekaa kya tha, main saal bhar muntazir raha, mujhey koi munasib mauqa na mil raha tha, yahan tak ke main Makka ke safar mein unke sath gaya, jab ham Marruz-Zohran pahunchey to wo qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye gaey aur kaha : mere paas pani ka aik lota ley aana, maine unhein la diya. jab wo apni haajat se farigh ho kar lautey , main ja kar un (ke hathon ( par pani dalney laga, to mujhey ( sawal ( yad aa gaya, maine unse puchha : aey ameerul-momeneen ! wo kon si 2 auratein thin ? maine abhi apni baat khatm na ki thi ke unhon-ne jawab diya : wo Aaisha aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anhunna) thin."
"3695","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Ubaidullah bin-Abdullah-bin abi Sor se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : main shiddat se khahish mand raha tha ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se un 2 ke barey mein sawal karun jinke mutaalliq Allah Taala ne farmaya : agar tum donon Allah se tauba karti ho to yaqinan tumharey dil aagey jhuk gaey hain yahan tak ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Haj (ka safar ( kya aur maine bhi unke sath Haj kya, (wapsi par) ham rastey ke aik hissey mein they ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) (apni zarurat ke liye rastey se) aik taraf hat gaey aur main bhi pani ka bartan lene unke sath hat gaya, wo sehra mein chaley gaey, phir mere paas aaey to maine unke hathon par pani undela, unhon-ne wuzu kya to maine kaha : aey ameerul-momeneen! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se wo 2 kon si thin jinke barey mein Allah Taala ne farmaya hai : agar tum donon Allah se tauba karo to yaqinan tumharey dil jhuk gaey hain? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Ibne-Abbas ! tum par tajjub hai ! . Zohri ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! unhon (ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu)) ne jo sawal unse kya, wo unhein bura laga aur unhon-ne ( iska jawab ( chhipaaya bhi nahi. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : wo Hafsa aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anhunna) thin. phir Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) baat sunaney lagey aur kaha : ham Quraish ke log aisi qaum they jo apni aurton par ghalib they, jab ham Madina aaey to ham ne aisey log paaey jin par unki auratein ghalib thin, chunanche hamari aurton ne bhi unki aurton se seekhna shuru kar diya. (mardon ko palat kar jawab dene lagin.) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : mera ghar oopri ilaaqey bani Umayya bin Zaid ke mahalley mein tha, aik din main apni biwi par naraz hua, to wo mujhey palat kar jawab dene lagi, mujhey iska jawab dena bada na-gawar guzra to usne kaha : tumhen ye na-gawar guzarta hai ke main tumhen jawab dun? Allah ki qism ! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyan bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jawab de deti hain, aur unmein se koi aik to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko raat tak pura din chhod bhi deti hai (roothi rehti hai.) main chala, Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan gaya aur kaha : kya tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko palat kar jawab de deti ho? unhon-ne kaha : ji haan. maine (phir) puchha : kya tum mein se koi unhein raat tak din bhar ke liye chhod bhi deti hai? unhon-ne kaha : ji haan ! maine kaha : tum mein se jisne bhi aisa kya wo naakaam hui aur khasaarey mein padi. kya tum mein se koi is baat se be-khof ho jati hai ke apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki narazgi ki wjah se Allah ( bhi) is par naraz ho jaeyga to wo tabah w barbad ho jaeygi? (aainda) tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko na jawab dena, na unse kisi cheez ka mutalba karna, tumhen jo chahiye mujh se maang lena. tumhen ye baat dhokey mein na daal de ke tumhari hamsaai (saukan) tum se zyada khoobsurat aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada mehbub hai. unki murad Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se thi. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Ansar mein se mera aik padosi tha. padhi. ham baari-baari (oopri ilaaqey se) utar kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hotey they. aik din wo utarta aur aik din main utarta, wo mere paas wahi wghaira ki khabrein laata aur main bhi (apni baari ke din) uske paas isi tarah ki khabrein laata aur (un dinon) ham aapas mein baatein kar rahe they ke ghassani hamarey sath ladai karne ke liye ghodon ko khadiyan laga rahe they, mera sathi ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir honey ke liye awaali se) utra , phir isha ke waqt mere paas aaya, mera darwaza khatkhataya, phir mujhey awaz di, main bahar nikla to usne kaha : aik bahut bada waqia roonuma ho gaya hai. maine puchha : kya hua? kya ghassani aa gaey? usne kaha : nahi, balke wo us se bhi bada aur lamba-chauda ( mamla) hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai. maine kaha : Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) to naakaam hui aur khasaarey mein pad gaee. main to (pahley hi) samajhta tha ke aisa honey wala hai. (doosrey din) jab main subah ki Namaz padh chuka to apne kapdey pahney , Madina mein aaya aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke paas gaya, wo ro rahi thi. maine puchha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum sab ko talaaq de di hai? usne kaha : main nahi janti, albatta aap alag thalag us baala-khaaney mein hain. main aap ke siyah faam ghulam ke paas aaya, aur usey kaha, umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye ijazat maango. wo gaya, phir meri taraf bahar aaya aur kaha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney tumhara zikr kya magar aap khamosh rahe. main chala aaya yahan tak ke member ke paas aa kar baith gaya, to wahan bahut se log baithey they, unmein se kuchh ro rahe they, mein thodi der betha, phir jo kaifiyat mujh par taari thi wo mujh par ghalib aa gaee. main phir ghulam ke paas aaya aur kaha : umr ke liye ijazat maango, wo andar dakhil hua, phir meri taraf bahar aaya aur kaha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney tumhara zikr kya, magar aap khamosh rahe. main peeth pher kar muda to achcha ghulam mujhey bulaney laga, aur kaha : andar chaley jao, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen ijazat de di hai. main andar dakhil hua, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam arz kya to dekha ke aap banti ki aik chataai par sahara lekar baithey they, jisne aap ke pahlu par nishan daal diye they, maine kaha : kya aap ne Allah ke rasool! apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai? aap ne meri taraf (dekhtey huey) apna sar Mubarak uthaya aur farmaya : nahi. maine kaha : Allahu-akbar . Allah ke rasool! agar aap hamein dekhtey to ham Quraish aisi qaum they jo apni beeviyon par ghalib rahtey they. jab ham Madina aaey to ham ne aisi qaum ko paya jinki auratein un par ghalib thin, to hamari aurton ne bhi unki aurton (ki aadat ( se seekhna shuru kar diya, chunanche aik din main apni biwi par barham hua to wo mujhey palat kar jawab dene lagi mujhey iska jawab dena intihai na-gawar guzra, usne kaha : tumhen ye na-gawar guzarta hai ke main tumhen jawab deti hun? Allah ki qism ! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyan bhi aapko jawab de deti hain, aur unmein se koi to aapko raat tak chhod bhi deti (rooth bhi jati) hai. to maine kaha : unmein se jisne aisa kya wo naakaam hui aur khasaarey mein padi . kya (ye kaam karke ( unmein se koi is baat se be khof ho sakti hai ke apne rasool ki narazagi ki wjah se Allah is par naraz ho jaey (agar aisa hua) to wo tabah ho gaee. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskura diye to maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! main Hafsa ke paas gaya aur us ne kaha : tumhen ye baat kisi dhokey mein na daal de ke tumhari hamsaai ( saukan ( tum se zyada khoobsurat aur Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tum se zyada mahboob hai. is par aap dobara muskuraaey to maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! ( kuchh der baith kar) baat cheet karun? aap ne farmaya : haan. chunanche main baith gaya aur maine sar uper karke ghar mein nigah daudaai to Allah ki qism ! usmein teen chamdon ke siwa kuchh na tha jis par nazar padti, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! dua farmaiye ke Allah aap ki ummat par faraakhi farmaey. faarsiyon aur roomiyon par wusat ki gaee hai halanke wo Allah Taala ki ibadat nahi kartey. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) seedhey ho kar baith gaey, phir farmaya : ibne-khattaab ! kya tum kisi shak mein mubtala ho? ye aisey log hain jinhein un (ke hissey ( ki achi cheezein jald hi duniya mein de di gaee hain. maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! mere liye bakhshish talab kijiye aur aap ne un ( beeviyon ( par sakht ghussey ki wjah se qism kha li thi ke aik mahina unke paas nahi jaengey. yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne aap par itaab farmaya, (ke beeviyon ki baat par aap kyon ghamzada hotey aur halal chizon se door rehney ki qism khaatey hain. ("
"3696","Zohri ne kaha : mujhey Urwa ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : jab untees raatein guzar gain , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laaey, aap ne mere ( ghar ( se shuruaat ki, maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! aap ne qism khaai thi ke mahina bhar hamarey paas nahi aaeingey, aur aap untiswein din tashrif laey hain, main unhein shumaar karti rahi hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bila shubah mahina untees din ka hai. phir farmaya : Aaisha ! main tum se aik baat karne laga hun, tumharey liye koi harj nahi ke tum apne waalidain se bhi mashwara karne tak usmein jaldi na karo. phir aap ne mere samney tilawat farmai : aey Nabi ! apni beeviyon se keh dijiye se lekar bahut bada ajr hai tak pahunch gaey. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! aapko b-khoobi ilm tha ke mere waalidain mujhey kabhi aap se judai ka mashwara nahi dengey. kaha : to maine kaha : kya main iske barey mein apne waalidain se mashwara karungi? main yaqinan Allah, uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aakhirat ke ghar ki talabgaar hun. Mamar ne kaha : mujhey Ayub ne khabar di ke Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : aap apni dusri beeviyon ko na bataein ke maine aapko chun liya hai. to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : Allah Taala ne mujhey muballigh ( pahunchane-wala ( bana kar bheja hai, kamzoriyaan dhoondney wala bana kar nahi bheja. Qatada ne kaha : ( صَغَتْ قُلُوبُكُمَا Mina ( ) Tahreem : 4 : 66 (ka mana hai : tum donon ke dil maail ho chukey hain."
"3697","Aswad bin Sufiyan ke Maula Abdullah-bin Yazeed ne abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman se, unhon-ne Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke abu Amr bin Hafs (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein talaaq bitta (hatami, teesri talaaq) de di, aur wo khud ghair hazir they, unke wakeel ne unki taraf se kuchh jau (wghaira) bhejey, to wo is par naraz huin, us ( wakeel ( ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! tumhara ham par koi haq nahi. wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein, aur ye baat aapko batai. aap ne farmaya : ab tumhara kharch iske zimmey nahi. aur aap ne unhein hukm diya ke wo Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar mein iddat guzaarein, phir farmaya is aurat ke paas mere sahaba aatey jatey hain, tum ibne-maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan iddat guzar lo, wo na-beena aadmi hain, tum apne ( odhney ke) kapdey bhi utaar sakti ho. tum jab ( iddat ki bandish se) aazad ho jao to mujhey batana . jab main ( iddat se) farigh hui, to maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bataya ke Muawiya bin abi Sufiyan aur abu-Jaheem (Raziallahu anhu) donon ne mujhey nikah ka paigham bheja hai. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : abu-Jaheem (Raziallahu anhu) to apne kandhey se laathi nahi utaarta, aur raha Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) to wo intihai faqeer hai, uske paas koi maal nahi, tum Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kar lo. maine usey na-pasand kya, aap ne phir farmaya : Usama (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kar lo. to maine unse nikah kar liya, Allah ne usmein khair daal di aur uski wjah se mujh par rashk kya janey laga."
"3698","abu-Hazim ne abu-Salma se, unhon-ne Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein unke shauhar ne unhein talaaq de di, aur us ne unhein bahut haqeer sa kharch diya, jab unhon-ne usey dekha to kaha : Allah ki qasam! main (is baat se) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zaroor aagah karungi, agar mere liye kharch hai to itna lungi jo meri guzraan durust kar de, agar mere liye kharch nahi hai to main us se kuchh bhi nahi lungi. unhon-ne kaha : maine is baat ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap ne farmaya : tumharey liye na kharch hai aur na rihaaish."
"3699","Imran bin abi Anas ne abu-Salma se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se malum kya to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke unke makhzumi shauhar ne unhein talaaq de di aur un par kharch karne se bhi inkar kar diya, to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur aapko is baat ki khabar di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey liye kharch nahi hai. ( wahan se) muntaqil ho kar ibn-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan chali jao aur wahin raho, wo na-beena aadmi hain, tum wahan apne (odhney ke) kapdey bhi utaar sakogi."
"3700","Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir se riwayat hai, (kaha :) mujhey abu-Salma ne khabar di ke Suhak bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki behen Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke abu-Hafs bin Mughira makhzumi (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey teen talaaqein de dein, phir Yaman ki taraf chala gaya, to iske azeez w aqaarib ne usey kaha : tumhara kharch hamarey zimmey nahi hai. Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) chand sathiyon ke sath aaey, Hazrat Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha : abu-Hafs ne apni biwi ko teen talaaqein de di hain, kya us (ki pichhli biwi (ke liye kharcha hai? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : uske liye kharcha nahi hai jabke uske liye iddat ( guzaarna) zaroori hai. aur aap ne uski taraf paigham bheja : apne barey mein mujh se ( mashwara karne se pahley) sabqat na karna aur usey hukm diya ke Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan muntaqil ho jaey, phir usey paigham bheja : Umme- Sharik ke yahan awwaleen muhajireen aatey hain, tum ibne- Maktum (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan chali jao, jab (kabhi) tum apni odhni utaarogi to wo tumhen nahi dekh sakengey. wo unke yahan chali gain, jab unki iddat poori ho gaee to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka nikah Usama-bin-Zaid bin Harisa (Raziallahu anhu) se kar diya."
"3701","Yahya bin Ayub, Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur ibne-Hujr ne hamein hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Ismail , yani ibne- Jafar ne Muhammad-bin Amr se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne hamein abu-Salma se, unhon-ne Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki. isi tarah hamein abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne hadis bayan ki. (kaha : ( ham se Muhammad-bin-Bishr ne hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( ham se Muhammad-bin Amr ne baqi bachi pichhli sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki : ( abu-Salma ne) kaha : maine Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke munh se sun kar ye hadis likhi, unhon-ne kaha : main banu- makhzoom ke aik aadmi ke yahan thi. usne mujhey teen talaaqein de dein to maine iske ghar walon ke yahan paigham bheja , main kharch ka mutalba kar rahi thi. padhi. aagey un sab ne abu-Salma se Yahya bin Kasir ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya, albatta Muhammad-bin Amr ki hadis mein hai : apne ( nikah ke) mamley main ( hamarey sath mashwara kiye baghair ( hamein peechhey na chhod dena."
"3702","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se riwayat ki, abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Auf ne unhein khabar di ke Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bataya ke wo abu Amr bin Hafs bin Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi thin, unhon-ne usey teenon talaaqon mein se aakhiri talaaq bhi de di, unka khayal tha ke wo apne ghar se bahar nikalney ke barey mein fatwa poochhney ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin , to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke na-beena ( sahabi ( ibn-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar muntaqil ho jaaein. Marwan ne (jab wo Madiney ka aamil tha) is baat se inkar kar diya ke wo mutallaqa aurat ke apne ghar se nikalney ke barey mein unki (baat ki) tasdeeq kare. aur Urwa ne kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bhi Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke samney is baat ko qabool karne se inkar kar diya."
"3703","Aqeel ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki, sath Urwa ka qaul bhi zikr kya ke Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke samney is baat ko naqabile-qabool qarar diya."
"3704","Mamar ne hamein Zohri se khabar di, unhon-ne Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba se riwayat ki ke abu-Amr-bin-Hafs-bin-Mugheera (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Ali-bin-abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Yaman ki taraf gaey aur apni biwi Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ko uski (teen) talaaqon mein se jo talaaq baqi thi bhej di, aur unhon-ne unke barey mein (apne azeezon ( Haris-bin-Hisham aur Ayash-bin-abi-Rabee se kaha ke wo unhein kharch dein, to un donon ne un (Fatima) se kaha : Allah ki qism ! tumharey liye koi kharch nahi siwaey-iske ke tum haamla hoti . wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur aapko un donon ki baat batai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumharey liye kharch nahi (bantaa). unhon-ne aap se naql makaani ki ijazat chahi to aap ne unhein ijazat de di. unhon-ne puchha : Allah ke rasoo! kahan? farmaya : ibn-Umme-Maktoom ke yahaan. wo naa-beenaa they, wo unke samney apne ( odhney ke) kapdey utaartin to wo unhein dekh nahi saktey they. jab unki iddat poori hui to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka nikah Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se kar diya. iske baad Marwan ne us hadis ke barey mein malum karne ke liye qabeesa-bin-zuweb ko unke paas bheja to unhon-ne usey ye hadis bayan ki, is par Marwan ne kaha : ham ne ye hadis sirf aik aurat se suni hai, ham to usi maqbool tareeqey ko thaamey rakhengey jis par ham ne tamam logon ko paya hai. jab Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko Marwan ki ye baat pahunchi to unhon-ne kaha : mere aur tumharey darmyan Quraan faisal hai. Allah Taala ne farmaya : tum unhein unke gharon se mat nikaalo. aayat mukammal ki. unhon-ne kaha : ye aayat to (jis tarah iske alfaz ( لَعَلَّ ٱللَّہَ يُحْدِثُ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ أَمْرًا ( ) الطلاق 1 : 65 )) se zahir hai) us ( shauhar (ke liye hui jisey rujoo ka haq hasil hai, aur teesri talaaq ke baad naye sirey se kon si baat paida ho sakti hai? aur tum ye baat kaisey kehtey ho ke agar wo haamla nahi hai to uske liye kharch nahi hai? phir tum usey roktey kis bana (wajah) par ho."
"3705","Zuhair-bin-Harab ne mujhey hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Hushaim ne hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein sayyaar, Husain, Mugheera, Ash'as, majaalid, Ismail-bin-abi-Khalid aur Dawud sab ne Shabi se khabar di. padhi. albatta Dawud ne kaha : hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. unhon-ne kaha : main Fatima-bint-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya aur unse Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke faisley ke mutaalliq malum kiya jo unke barey mein tha. unhon-ne kaha : unke shauhar ne unhein teen talaaqein de dein, kaha : to main rihaaish aur kharch ke liye iske sath apna jhagdaa lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaee. kaha : to aap ne mujhey rihaaish aur kharch (ka haq ( na diya, aur mujhey hukm diya ke main apni iddat-ibn-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar guzaaron."
"3706","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Hushaim ne Husain, Dawood, Mugheera, Ismail aur Ash'as se, unhon-ne Shabi se khabar di ke unhon-ne kaha : main Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaya. padhi. ( aagey ( Hushaim se Zuhair ki riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah hai."
"3707","Qurra ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein sayyaar-abul-Hakam ne hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Shabi ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey, unhon-ne ibne-taab ki taaza khajooron se hamari ziyaafat (mahman nawazi) ki, aur hamein umda jau ke sattu pilaaey , iske baad maine unse aisi aurat ke barey mein puchha jisey teen talaaqein di gaee hon ke wo iddat kahan guzaarey gii? unhon-ne jawab diya : mujhey mere shauhar ne teen talaaqein dein to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey ijazat di ke main apne gharaaney mein iddat guzaaron. ( ibne- Maktum (Raziallahu anhu) unke azeez they.)"
"3708","Salma-bin-kuheil ne Shabi se aur unhon-ne Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne aisi aurat ke barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki jisey teen talaaqein de di gaee hon, aap ne farmaya : uske liye na rihaaish hai aur na kharch ."
"3709","yahyaa-bin-aadam ne hamein khabar di, (kaha : ( Ammar-bin-ruzaiq ne hamein Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Shabi se aur unhon-ne Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mere shauhar ne mujhey teen talaaqein dein to maine ( wahan se) naqle-makaani ka irada kiya. main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui, to aap ne farmaya : tum apne chacha zaad Amr-bin-umme-maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar muntaqil ho jao, aur unke yahaan iddat guzaaro."
"3710","abu-Ahmad ne hamein khabar di, (kaha : ( Ammar-bin-ruzeiq ne hamein Abu-Ishaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Aswad-bin-Yazeed ( Nakhai (ke sath ( Kufa ki) badi masjid mein betha hua tha, Shabi bhi hamarey sath they, to Shabi ne Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein rihaaish aur kharch (ka haq) nahi diya. phir Aswad ne muththi bhar kankariyaan lein aur unhein de maarein aur kaha : tum par afsos ! tum is tarah ki hadis bayan kar rahe ho? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tha : ham aik aurat ke qaul ki wjah se Allah ki kitab aur uske rasool ki sunnat ko nahi chhod saktey, ham nahi jantey ke usne (is masley ko) yad rakha hai ya bhool gaee, uske liye rihaaish aur kharch hai. (aur ye aayat tilawat ki) izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne farmaya : ''tum unhein unke gharon se na nikaalo, aur na wo khud nikleyn, magar ye ke wo koi khuli be hayaai kareyn."
"3711","Sulaiman-bin-Muaz ne Abu-Ishaq se isi sanad ke sath Ammar-bin-razeeq se riwayat ki hui abu-Ahmad ki hadis ke ham mana hadis mukammal qissey samet bayan ki."
"3712","Wakee ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Abu-Bakar bin-abu-Jaheem-bin sikhkheer adwi se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo keh rahi thin ke unke shauhar ne unhein teen talaaqein dein. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein rihaaish di na kharch. kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey farmaya : jab ( iddat se) aazad ho jao to mujhey itlaa dena so maine aapko itlaa di. Muawiya , abu-Jaheem aur Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne unki taraf paigham bheja , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) to faqeer hai uske paas maal nahi hai, aur raha abu-Jaheem (Raziallahu anhu) to wo aurton ko bahut maarney wala hai, albatta Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) hai. unhon-ne (na-pasandidgi ka izhar kartey huey) hath se is tarah ishara kiya : Usama ! Usama ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein farmaya : Allah aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki itaat tumharey liye behtar hai. kaha : to maine unse shadi kar li, iske baad mujh par rashk kiya janey laga."
"3713","Abdur-Rehman ne hamein Sufiyan se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Bakar-bin-abi-jaham se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo keh rahi thin : mere shauhar abu-Amr-bin-Hafs-bin-Mugheera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ayash-bin-abi-Rabee (Raziallahu anhu) ko meri talaaq ka paigham de kar bheja aur uske sath panch saa khajoorein aur panch saa jau bhi bhejey. maine kaha : kya mere liye sirf yahi kharch hai? kya main tum logon ke ghar mein iddat nahi guzaaron gi? us ne jawab diya : nahi. unhon-ne kaha : maine apne kapdey sametey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui to aap ne puchha : wo tumhen kitni talaaqein de chukey hain? maine jawab diya : teen . aap ne farmaya is ne sach kaha, tumharey liye kharch nahi hai. apne chacha zaad Amr-bin-umme-maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar iddat guzaaro. wo naa-beenaa hain tum unke yahaan apna odhney ka kapda utaar sako gi . jab tumhari iddat khatm ho jaey to mujhey itlaa dena. unhon-ne ( aa kar) kaha : mujhey kai logon ne nikah ka paigham bheja hai, unmein Muawiya aur abu-Jaheem (Raziallahu anhu) bhi hain. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) to faqeer aur maflook (tabaahi) ki halat mein hai, aur rahe abu-Jaheem (Raziallahu anhu) to wo aurton par bahut sakhti kartey hain. padhi. ya wo aurton ko maartey hain, ya is tarah ki koi aur baat kahi . padhi. albatta tum Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ko qabool kar lo."
"3714","abu-Aasim ne hamein khabar di (kaha : ( hamein Sufiyan-Sory ne Abu-Bakar-bin-abi-jaham se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : main aur abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan hazir huey. ham ne unse sawal kiya, to unhon-ne kaha : main abu-Amr-bin-Hafs-bin-Mugheera (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi thi, wo Najran ki ladai mein nikley, aagey unhon-ne ibne- Mehdi ki hadis ke ham mana bayan kiya aur ye izafa kiya : ( Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : to maine un ( Usama (Raziallahu anhu)) se shadi kar li, Allah ne Abu-Zaid ( Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu)) ki wjah se mujhey sharf bakhshaa , Allah ne Abu-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki wjah se mujhey izzat di."
"3715","Shoba ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( Abu-Bakar (bin-abi-jaham) ne mujhey hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : main aur abu-Salma, ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamane-khilafat mein, Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey to unhon-ne hamein hadis bayan ki ke unke shauhar ne unhein teen talaaqein dein, aagey Sufiyan ki hadis ki tarah hai."
"3716","( Abdullah-bin-Yasar) bahyee ne Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mere shauhar ne mujhey teen talaaqein dein to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere liye rihaaish aur kharch nahi rakha."
"3717","Urwa-bin-Zubair ne kaha : Yahya-bin-Saeed-bin-aas ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Hakam ki beti se shadi ki, baad mein usey talaaq de di aur usey apne yahan se bhi nikal diya. Urwa ne is baat ki wjah se un par sakht aetraz kiya, to unhon-ne kaha : Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ( bhi apne khawind ke ghar se) chali gaee thi. Urwa ne kaha : is par main Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur unhein ye baat batai to unhon-ne kaha : Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye is hadis ko bayan karne mein koi khair nahi hai."
"3718","Fatima-binte-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool ! mujhey mere shauhar ne teen talaaqein de dein hain, aur main darti hun ke koi ghus kar mujh par hamla kar dega, kaha : is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya to unhon-ne jagah badal li."
"3719","Shoba ne hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid ( Qasim ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne kaha : is baat ko bayan karne mein Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke liye koi bhalai nahi hai ke na rihaaish hai na kharch."
"3720","Sufiyan ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se aur unhon-ne apne walid (Qasim) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Urwa-bin-Zubair ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se puchha : kya aap ne fulaana binte-Hakam ko nahi dekha? iske shauhar ne usey teen talaaqein dein to wo (uske ghar se) chali gaee. ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha is ne bura kiya. Urwa ne puchha : kya aap ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ka qaul nahi sunaa? to unhon-ne jawab diya : dekho ! usko bayan karne mein uske liye koi bhalai nahi hai."
"3721","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : meri khala ko talaaq ho gaee, unhon-ne ( dauraane-iddat ( apni khajooron ka phal todney ka irada kiya, to aik aadmi ne unhein ( ghar se) bahar nikalney par daantaa. wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin , to aap ne farmaya : kyon nahi, apni khajooron ka phal todo, mumkin hai ke tum (is se) sadqa karo ya koi aur achchha kaam karo."
"3722","ibne-Shahab se riwayat hai, ( unhon-ne kaha : ( mujhey Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullah-bin-Utba-bin-Masood ne hadis bayan ki ke unke walid ne Umar-bin-Abdullah-bin-arqam Zohri ko hukm detey huey likha ke sabeeaa-binte-Haaris Aslamiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jayen, aur unse unke waqiey ke barey mein aur unke fatwa poochhney par jo kuchh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya tha uske barey mein poochhein . chunanche Umar-bin-Abdullah ne Abdullah-bin-utba ko khabar detey huey likha ke sabeeaa ne unhein bataya hai ke wo Sad-bin-khaula (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi thin, wo bani Aamir-bin looie mein se they aur wo badr mein Shareek honey walon mein se they. wo Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par, faut ho gaey they jabke wo haamla thin. unki wafat ke baad zyada waqt na guzra tha ke unhon-ne bachchey ko janm diya. jab wo apne nifaas se paak huin to unhon-ne nikah ka paigham deney walon ke liye (ke unhein unki iddat se faraghat ka pata chal jaey kuchh) banao singhaar kiya. banu- abdud-daar ka aik aadmi . padhi. abu-Sanaabil-bin-ba'kak. padhi. unke yahaan aaya to unse kaha : kya baat hai main aapko bani sanwarii dekh raha hoon? shayad aapko nikah ki ummeed hai? Allah ki qism ! aap nikah nahi kar saktin yahan tak ke aap par char mahiney das din guzar jaaein. sabeeaa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : jab usne mujhey ye baat kahi to Sham ke waqt maine apne kapdey sametey, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur aap se iske barey mein malum kiya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey fatwa diya ke main usi waqt halal ho chuki hun jab maine bachcha janaa tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne, agar main munasib samjhoon to mujhey shadi karne ka hukm diya. ibne-Shahab ne kaha : main koi harj nahi samajhta ke waza' hamal ke sath hi , chahey wo apne ( nifaas ke) khoon mein ho, aurat nikah kar ley , albatta uska shauhar uske paak honey tak uske qareeb na jaey."
"3723","abdul-wahaab ne kaha : maine Yahya-bin-Saeed se suna, ( unhon-ne kaha : ( mujhey Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ne khabar di ke abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) donon Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan ikatthey huey aur wo donon us aurat ka zikr karne lagey jiska apne shauhar ki wafat se chand raaton ke baad nifaas shuru ho jaey. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : uski iddat do waqton mein se aakhir wali hai. abu-Salma ne kaha : wo halal ho chuki hai. wo donon is mamley mein bahas karne lagey, to Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main apne bhatijey, yani abu-Salma ke sath hun. iske baad unhon-ne is masley ke barey mein malum karne ke liye Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam Kureb ko Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf bhejaa. wo (wapas ( unke paas aaya to unhein bataya ke Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha hai : sabeeaa Aslamiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne shauhar ki wafat se chand raaton ke baad bachcha janaa tha, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is baat ka zikr kiya to aap ne unhein nikah karne ka hukm diya tha."
"3724","Leis aur Yazid-bin-Harun donon ne isi sanad ke sath Yahya-bin-Saeed se riwayat ki, albatta Leis ne apni hadis mein kaha : unhon-ne ( kisi ko) Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf bhejaa. unhon-ne Kureb ka naam nahi liya."
"3725","Humaid-bin-Naafe ne Zainab-binte-abi-Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne in ( Humaid ( ko ye teen hadisein bayan kein, kaha : Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi mohtarma Hazrat Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ke walid Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) faut huey to main unke yahaan gaee, Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ne zard rang mili makhloot ya koi aur khushbu mangwaai , usmein se (pahley ( aik bachchi ko lagai (taake ( hath par uski miqdar bahut kam ho jaey) phir apne rukhsaaron par hath mal liya. phir kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ki zarurat na thi magar ( baat ye hai ke) maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par irshad farma rahe they : kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah Taala aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho, halal nahi ke wo kisi bhi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog manaaey, magar khawind par, char maah das din (sog manaaey)."
"3726","Zenab ( binte-abi-Salma (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : phir main Zainab-binte-( Jahash ( (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan us waqt gaee jab unke bhai ( Ubaidullah-bin-Jahash ( faut huey, to unhon-ne bhi khushbu mangwaai aur lagai , phir kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ki zarurat na thi magar ( baat ye hai ke) maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par irshad farma rahe they : kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah par aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti hai, halal nahi ke wo kisi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog karey magar shauhar par, char mahiney das din (sog kare)."
"3727","Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : maine apni walida Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se suna wo keh rahi thin, aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur kaha : Allah ke rasool! meri beti ka shauhar faut ho gaya hai. aur uski aankhon mein takleef hai. kya ham usey surma laga dein? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nahi do ya teen baar ( puchha gaya) har baar aap farmatey : nahi, phir farmaya : ye to sirf char maah das din hain. halanke jahiliyat main tum mein se aik aurat ( pura ( aik saal guzarney ke baad mengni phainkaa karti thi."
"3728","Humaid ne kaha : maine Zenab (Raziallahu anha) se puchha : aik saal guzarney par mengni phainknaa kya hai? Zenab ne jawab diya : ( jahiliyat mein) jab kisi aurat ka shauhar faut ho jata tha to wo aik ( dabdein numaa ( intihai tang jhounpdi mein chali jaati, apne badtareen kapdey pahan leti aur koi khushbu wghaira istemal na karti. yahan tak ke (isi haalat mein) saal guzar jata, phir uske paas koi janwar gadhaa , bakri ya koi parinda laya jata, to wo usey apni sharmgah se malti, kam hi hota ke wo kisi ko malti to wo zinda rehta ( sakht ta'ffun (badbu) aur jaraaseem wghaira ki bina par bimar ho kar mar jata) phir wo bahar nikalti to usey aik mengni di jati jisey wo (apne aagey ya peechhey) phainkti, phir iske baad khushbu wghaira jo wo chahti istemal karti."
"3729","Humaid-bin-Naafe se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Zainab-binte-abi-Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ka koi intihai qaribi azeez faut ho gaya. unhon-ne zard rang ki khushbu mangwai aur usey halka sa apne ( rukhsar aur) baazuon par lagaya , aur kaha : main isliye aisa kar rahi hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they : kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah Taala aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho, halal nahi ke wo ( kisi marney waley par) teen din se zyada sog manaaey , magar khawind par char mahiney das din ( sog manaaey )."
"3730","Zenab ne unhein ( Humaid ko) apni walida (Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ( se aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Zenab (Raziallahu anha) se ya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se kisi se yahi hadis bayan ki."
"3731","Humaid bin Naafe se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Zenab binte- abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo apni walida se hadis bayan kar rahi thin ke aik aurat ka shauhar faut ho gaya, unhein uski aankh ke barey mein) bimari laahiq honey ka ( khatrah mehsus hua to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey, aur aap se surma lagaaney ki ijazat mangi , is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi apne ghar ke badtareen hissey main apne taaton mein. padhi. ya farmaya : apne badtareen taaton mein apne ghar ke andar . saal bhar rehti, iske baad jab koi kutta guzarta to wo aik leed phainkti aur bahar nikalti to kya ( ab ( char mahiney das din ( sabr ( nahi ( kar sakti .)"
"3732","Muaaz-bin-Muaaz ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Shoba ne Humaid bin Naafe se ikatthi 2 hadisein bayan kin, surma lagaaney ke barey mein Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki hadis aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein se aik aur biwi ki hadis , albatta unhon-ne unka naam , Zenab nahi liya. padhi. ( baqi hadis) Muhammad-bin-Jafar ki (pichhli ( hadis ki tarah ( bayan ki.)"
"3733","Humaid bin Naafe se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Zenab binte- abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo Hazrat Umme-Salma aur Hazrat Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahi thin, wo donon ye bata rahi thin ke aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas hazir hui aur kaha ke uski aik beti ka shauhar faut ho gaya hai, uski aankh mein takleef ho gaee hai wo chahti hai ke usmein surma lagaey , Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : bila shubah tum mein se koi aurat ( pura ( saal guzarney par leed phainka karti thi, aur ye to sirf char mahiney das din hain."
"3734","Zenab binte-abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : jab Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas (unke walid ( Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) ki maut ki khabar aai to unhon-ne teesrey din zard rang ki khushbu mangwaai aur usey apne baazuon aur rukhsaaron par halka sa lagaya aur kaha : mujhey iski zarurat na thi, ( magar ( maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna tha : kisi aurat ke liye jo Allah Taala aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti ho, halal nahi ke wo ( kisi marney waley par) teen din se zyada sog manaaey , siwaey shauhar ke , wo is par char mahiney das din sog manaaey ."
"3735","Lais-bin-Sad ne Naafe se riwayat ki ke Safiya binte- abi Ubaid ne unhein Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se ya Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ya un donon se hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi aurat ke liye, jo Allah Taala aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhti hai. ya farmaya : Allah Taala aur uske rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par eman rakhti hai. halal nahi ke wo apne shauhar ke siwa kisi bhi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog manaaey ."
"3736","Abdullah-bin-Dinar ne Naafe se Leis ki hadis ki sanad ke sath usi ki manind (tarah) riwayat bayan ki."
"3737","Yahya-bin-Saeed kehtey hain : maine Naafe se suna, wo Safiya binte- abu-Ubaid se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bevi Hafsa binte- umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hadis bayan kar rahi thin. padhi. jis tarah Leis aur ibne- Dinar ki hadis hai. aur ye izafa kya : wo is par char mahiney das din sog manaaeygi."
"3738","Ayub aur Ubaidullah donon ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Safiya binte-abi-Ubaid se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kisi aur ahliya se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se un ( Lais-bin-Sad , Abdullah-bin-Dinar aur Yahya-bin-Saeed ( ki hadis ke jaisi hadis riwayat ki."
"3739","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : kisi aurat ke liye, jo Allah Taala aur qiyamat ke din par eman rakhti hai, halal nahi ke wo apne shauhar ke siwa kisi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog manaaey."
"3740","ibne-Idrees ne hamein Hisham se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se aur unhon-ne umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi aurat kisi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog na manaaey, magar khawind par, (us par) char mahiney das din (sog manaaey) na wo asab ke khaana daar kapdey ke siwa koi ranga hua kapda pahney, na surma lagaey, magar (is doran mein) jab ( haiz se) paak ho to mamuli si qust ya azfar ( jaisi koi cheez ( istemal kar ley. (ye donon khushbuein nahi, sirf badboo ko khatm karne waley b-khor hain)"
"3741","Abdullah-bin-Numair aur Yazid-bin-Harun, donon ne Hisham se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, aur donon ne kaha : tuhur ke shuruat mein thodi si qist aur azfar laga ley."
"3742","Ayub ne Hafsa se, unhon-ne umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein mana kya jata tha ke ham kisi marney waley par teen din se zyada sog manaaein . magar khawind par, (us par) char mahiney das din ( sog hai.) na surma lagaaein , na khushbu istemal karein aur na ranga hua kapda pahnein, aur aurat ko iske tuhur mein, jab ham mein se koi apne haiz se ghusl kar ley, ijazat di gaee ke wo thodi si qust aur azfar istemal kar ley."
"3743","Sahal-bin-Sad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Uwemir Ajlani (Raziallahu anhu), Aasim bin Adi Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur unse kaha aey Aasim ! bhala agar koi shakhs apni joru ke sath kisi mard ko dekhey kya usko mar daaley, phir tum usko mar dalogey ya wo kya karey? to ye masla poochho mere waastey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha aap ne is qism ke sawaalon ko na-pasand kya aur unki burai bayan ki. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna wo unko sakht guzra . jab wo apne logon mein lot kar aaey to Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) unke paas aaey aur puchha aey Aasim! janabe-Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaaya? Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha to mere liye achi cheez nahi laya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tera masla poochhna na-gawar hua. Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha qism khuda ki main to baaz na aaunga jab tak ye masla aap se na poochhunga. phir Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) aaey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas tamam logon main aur arz kya ya Rasulullah ! aap kya farmatey hain agar koi shakhs apni bevi ke paas ghair mard ko dekhey usko mar daaley, phir aap usko mar daalengey (iske qisaas mein) wo kya karey? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya terey aur teri joru ke baab mein Allah ka hukm utra (yani aayate-liaan ki) to ja aur apni bevi ko lekar aa. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha phir donon miyan bevi ne liaan kya aur main logon ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas maujood tha jab wo farigh huey to Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ya Rasulullah agar main us aurat ko ab rakhun to main jhoota hun phir Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko teen talaaq de din is se pahley ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usko hukm kartey ibne-Shahab ne kaha phir liaan karne walon ka yahi tariqa thehar gaya."
"3744","Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Uwemir Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) jo bani Ajlan mein se tha Aasim bin Adi (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaya phir bayan kya hadis ko akheer tak isi tarah jaisey uper guzri aur hadis mein ibne-Shahab ka qaul bhi Sharik kar diya ke phir judai mard ko aurat se sunnat ho gaee liaan karne walon main aur itna zyada kya ke Sehal ne kaha wo aurat haamla thi iske betey ko maa ki taraf nisbat karke pukaartey phir ye tariqa jari hua ke aisa ladka apni maan ka waaris hoga aur wo uski waaris hogi apne hissey ke muwafiq ."
"3745","ibne-Juraij se riwayat hai ke mujh se ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya mutlaaeneen (Liaan karnewaley) ka haal aur unka tariqa Sahal-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis se jo bani saaida mein se tha usne kaha Ansar mein se aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kya ya Rasulullah aap kya samajhtey hain agar koi shakhs apni joru ke sath kisi mard ko dekhey aur bayan kya Sara qissa hadis ka aur itna zyada kya ke phir donon ne liaan kya masjid ke andar aur main maujood tha aur is riwayat mein ye bhi hai ke us shakhs ne talaaq di teen baar apni aurat ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm karne se pahley phir wo juda ho gaya us se aap ke samney aap ne farmaya yahi judai hai darmyan liaan karne walon ke."
"3746","Saeed-bin-Jubair se riwayat hai mujh se puchha gaya liaan karne walon ka masla Musab bin Zuber ki khilafat mein, main hairan hua kya jawab dun to main chala Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke makan ki taraf Makka main aur unke ghulam se kaha merey aaney ka zikr karo. usne kaha wo aaraam kartey hain. unhon-ne meri awaz suni aur kaha kya Juber ka betaa hai? maine kaha haan unhon-ne kaha andar aa qism khuda ki to kisi kaam se aaya hoga. main andar aa gaya to wo aik kambal bichhaaey baithey they aur aik takiye par tek lagaey they jo chhaal se khajoor ki bhara hua tha. maine kaha aey abu-Abdur-Rehman ! liaan karne walon mein judai ki jaeygi ? unhon-ne kaha Subhan-Allah beshak judai ki jaeygi aur sabse pahley is baab mein falan ne puchha jo falan ka betaa tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. usne kaha ya Rasulullah aap kya samajhtey hain agar ham mein se koi apni aurat ko bura kaam karatey dekhey to kya karey, agar munh se nikaley to buri baat nikalega agar chup rahe to aisi buri baat se kyonkar chup rahe ? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye sun kar chup ho rahe aur jawab nahi diya. phir wo shakhs aap ke paas aaya aur kehney laga, ya Rasulullah. jo baat maine aap se poochhi thi main khud usmein pad gaya. tab Allah Taala ne ye aayatein utaarin sura Noor mein) والذین یرمون ازواجھم ( aakhir tak. aap ne ye aayatein mard ko padh kar sunain aur usko nasihat ki aur samjhaaya ke duniya ka azab aakhirat ke azab se aasan hai. (yani agar to jhoot bohtan baandhta hai to ab bhi bol de, hade-qazaf ke assi kode pad jaeinge, magar ye jahannam mein jalney se aasan hai). wo bola nahi qism uski jisne aapko sachchaai ke sath bheja maine aurat par bohtan nahi joda . phir aap ne aurat ko bulaya aur usko daraaya aur samjhaya aur farmaya duniya ka azab Sehal hai aakhirat ke azab se. wo boli nahi qism uski jisne aapko sachchaai ke sath bheja hai mera khawind jhoot bolta hai. tab aap ne shuru kya mard se aur us ne char gawahiyan din Allah Taala ke naam ki muqarrar ke wo sachcha hai aur paanchwin baar mein ye kaha ke khuda ki phitkar ho is par agar wo jhoota ho. phir aurat ko bulaya us ne char gawahiyan dein Allah Taala ke naam ki muqarrar ke mard jhoota hai aur paanchwein baar mein ye kaha Allah ka ghazab utrey is par agar mard sachcha hai. iske baad aap ne judai kara di un donon mein."
"3747","is sanad se hi mandarja bula riwayat naql ki gaee hai."
"3748","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya liaan karne walon ko , tum donon ka hisab Allah Taala par hai, tum mein se aik jhoota hai. aap ne khawind se farmaya ab tera koi bas aurat par nahi hai kyonke wo tujh se hamesha ke liye juda ho gaee. mard bola mera maal ya Rasulullah ! jo usney liya hai. aap ne farmaya maal tujh ko nahi milega , kyonke agar to sachcha hai to maal ka badla hai jo uski farj tujh par halal ho gaee aur agar to jhoota hai to maal aur door ho gaya ( balke terey uper aur wabaal hua jhoot ka ( . Zuhair ne apni riwayat mein kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Amr se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Jubair se suna wo ke rahe they : maine Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya."
"3749","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne judai kar di bani-Ajlan ki joru aur mard main aur farmaya Allah Taala janta hai tum mein se koi jhoota hai. phir kya tum mein se koi tauba karta hai?"
"3750","Saeed-bin-Jubair se riwayat hai ke maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se liaan ko puchha to unhon-ne naql kya janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aisa hi jaisey uper guzra."
"3751","Saeed-bin-Jubair se riwayat hai Musab ne judai nahi ki liaan karne walon mein. maine iska zikr kya Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se. unhon-ne kaha janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne judai kar di bani Ajlan ke mard aur aurat mein."
"3752","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik mard ne liaan kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein phir aap ne judai kar di donon main aur bachchey ka nasb maan se laga diya."
"3753","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne liaan karwaya darmyan aik mard Ansari aur uski aurat ke aur judai kar di un donon mein."
"3754","wahi jo uper guzra ."
"3755","Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, main Juma ki raat ko masjid mein tha itney mein aik mard Ansari aaya aur bola agar koi apni joru ke paas kisi mard ko paaey aur munh se nikaley to tum usko kode lagaaogey (hade-qazaf ke) agar mar daley to tum usko mar daalogey ( qisaas mein) agar chup rahe to apna ghussa pi kar chup rahe. qism Allah ki main janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochhunga is masley ko jab doosra din hua to janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur aap se puchha usne kaha agar koi shakhs apni bevi ke sath kisi ko paaey phir munh se nikaley to tum kode lagaaogey agar mar daley to tum usko bhi mar daalogey agar chup rahe to apna ghussa kha kar chup rahe (ye bhi nahi ho sakta ( janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Allah khol de (is mushkil ko) aur dua karne lagey tab liaan ki aayat utri . والذین یرمون ازواجھم ولم یکن لھم shohdaa الا انفسھم . akheer tak phir us mard ka imtihaan liya gaya logon ke samney aur wo uski joru donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur liaan kya pahley mard ne gawahi di char baar ke wo sachcha hai phir paanchwein baar laanat karke kaha agar wo jhoota ho to is par laanat hai khuda taala ki phir aurat chali liaan karne ko aap ne farmaya thehar (aur agar khawind ki baat sach hai to too apne qasoor ka iqrar kar) lekin us ne na maana aur liaan kya jab peeth mod kar chaley to aap ne farmaya us aurat ka bachcha shayad kaley rang ka ghoongariyaley baalon wala paida hoga (us shakhs ki sura par jiska khawind ko guman tha). phir waisa hi kala ghoongariyaley baalon wala paida hua."
"3756","Aamash se is sanad ke sath isi tarah manqul hai."
"3757","Muhammad se riwayat hai maine Anas-bin-Malik se puchha ye samajh karke unko malum hai. unhon-ne kaha ke Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) ne nisbat ki zina ki apni biwi ko Sharik bin Sehma se aur Sharik bin Sehma, Bara bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ka maa-jaaya bhai tha aur us ( Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu)) ne sabse pahley liaan kya Islam mein. rawi ne kaha phir donon miyan biwi ne liaan kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya us aurat ko dekhtey raho agar iska bachcha safaid rang ka, seedhey baal waala, laal aankhon wala paida ho to wo Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) ka hai aur jo surmai aankhon waala, ghungariyaley baalon waala, patli pindliyon wala paida ho to wo Sharik bin Sehma ka hai. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha mujh ko khabar pahunchi ke us aurat ka ladka surmagin aankh, ghungariyaley baal aur patli pindliyon wala paida hua."
"3758","Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas liaan ka zikr hua. Aasim bin Adi (Raziallahu anhu) ne usmein kuchh kaha phir wo chaley gaey. tab unke paas unki qaum ka aik shakhs aaya aur shikayat karne laga ke usne apni bevi ke sath aik mard ko dekha. Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, main us bila mein mubtala hua apni baat ki wjah se. phir Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) usko lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur us shakhs ne Sara haal aap se bayan kya wo shakhs zard rang dublaa seedhey baalon wala tha aur jis par dawa karta tha wo par gosht pindliyon waalaa, gandam rang , mota tha. janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Allah to khol de. phir wo aurat bachcha jani jo mushabeh (similar) tha us shakhs ke jis par tohmat thi. tab janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne liaan karwaya donon mein. aik shakhs bola aey Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ! kya ye aurat wahi aurat thi, jiske liye janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha agar main kisi ko baghair gawaahon ke sangsaar karta to is aurat ko karta. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha nahi wo dusri aurat thi jo musalmanon mein burai ke sath mashhoor thi (yani log kehtey they ke ye faahisha hai na gawah they na iqrar tha) ."
"3759","tarjama dusri riwayat ka wahi hai jo uper guzra . usmein itna zyada hai ke wo shakhs jiske sath tohmat thi mota , sakht ghungariyaley baalon wala tha."
"3760","Qasim-bin-Muhammad se riwayat hai Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke samney liaan walon ka zikr hua to Abdullaah-bin-Shaddad ne kaha un hi mein wo aurat thi jiske liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha agar main kisi ko baghair gawaahon ke rajm (sangsaar) karta to us aurat ko rajm (sangsaar) karta. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : nahi wo aurat dusri aurat thi jo ailaaniya badkaar thi. ibne-abi-Umar ne Qasim-bin-Muhammad se bayan ki hui apni riwayat mein kaha ke unhon ( Qasim ( ne kaha : maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna."
"3761","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Sad-bin-Ubada Ansari (Raziallahu anhu)) Ansar ke raees ( ne kaha ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! agar koi shakhs apni bevi ke sath kisi mard ko paaey ( zina kartey huey) kya usko mar daaley? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya nahi. Sad ne kaha nahi mar daley qism uski jisne aapko sachchai ke sath izzat di. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (aur sahaba se) suno tumharey sardaar kya kehtey hain. (yani tajjub hai unse ke aisi baat kehtey hain Allah Taala ke hukm ke samney tabiat aur ghussa ko dakhal na dena chahiye ( ."
"3762","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! agar main apni biwi ke paas ghair mard ko dekhun to kya usko mohlat dun char gawah laney tak ? aap ne farmaya : haan."
"3763","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ya rasoolullah! agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi mard ko dekhun to main usko hath na lagaaun jab tak char gawah na laaun ? aap ne farmaya be-shak . Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha hargiz nahi main to qism uski jisne aapko sachchai ke sath bheja jaldi iska ilaaj talwaar se kar dun us se pahley . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya suno tumharey sardar kya kehtey hain wo badey ghairat daar hain aur main unse zyada ghairat daar hun aur Allah jalle-jalalahu mujh se zyada ghairat rakhta hai."
"3764","Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha agar main apni bevi ke paas kisi mard ko dekhun to talwaar se mar daalun kabhi na chhodun . ye khabar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi aap ne farmaya : tum Sad ki ghairat se tajjub kartey ho, qism Allah ki main unse zyada ghairat-daar hun aur Allah mujh se zyada ghairat daar hai. haram kya Allah ne be sharmi ki baton ko chhipi aur khuli isi ghairat ki wjah se aur koi shakhs Allah Taala se zyada ghairat daar nahi hai aur Allah se zyada kisi shakhs ko uzr pasand nahi hai. usi liye Allah Taala ne paighambaron ko bheja khushi aur dar sunatey huey (taake bandey saza se pahley uski baargah mein uzr kar lein aur tauba karein (aur kisi shakhs ko Allah se zyada tareef pasand nahi isliye Allah Taala ne wada kya jannat ka (taake bandey uski ibadat aur tareef karke jannat hasil kar lein). ,"
"3765","is sanad se bhi ye hadis marwi hai is riwayat main ( , غَیْرَ مُصْفَعٍ , (ke alfaz hain aur) , عَنْہ , ( nahi hai."
"3766","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai aik shakhs bani Fazara mein se aaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aur kaha meri joru ko aik kala bachcha paida hua hai (to wo mera malum nahi hota kyonke main kala nahi hun) . janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya terey paas oont hain? usne kaha haan hain. aap ne farmaya unka rang kya hai? wo bola laal hai. aap ne farmaya unmein koi khaaki bhi hai? usne kaha haan khaaki bhi hain. aap ne farmaya phir ye rang kahan se aaya? usne kaha kisi rag ne ghaseet liya hoga. aap ne farmaya is bachchey ko bhi kisi rag ne ghaseet liya hoga."
"3767","Zohri ne ibne-Uena ki hadis ki manind (tarah) riwayat ki usmein itna farq hai ke kaha aey Rasulullah ! meri aurat ne ladka siyah janaa hai aur mera irada hai ke iska inkar karun aur dusri hadis mein itna zyada hai ke phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske inkar karne ki ijazat na di."
"3768","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehati aaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aur kaha aey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! meri aurat ne kala bachcha jana hai aur main iska inkar karta hun, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko farmaya terey paas oont hain? usne kaha haan. aap ne farmaya unka rang kaisa hai? usne kaha surkh . aap ne puchha ke unmein koi kala bhi hai? wo bola haan to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye rang kahan se aa gaya? dehati bola ke aey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi rag ne ghaseet liya hoga to janab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke yahan bhi kisi rag ne ghaseet liya hoga."
"3769","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah ki riwayat bayan kartey hain."
"3770","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ne farmaya jo shakhs apna hissey aazad karey barda mein se (yani wo barda mushtarak ho) aur aik Sharik apna hissey aazad karey aur phir aazad karne waley ke paas is qadr maal ho jo bardey ki qeemat ko pahunch ‌jaey to us bardey ki waajibi qeemat lagai jaey aur baqi sharikon ko in ke hissey ki qeemat iske maal main se di jaeygi aur kal barda uski taraf se aazad ho jaeyga ‌ aur jo wo maaldar na ho to jis qadr hissey us barda ka aazad hua itna hi aazad rahega. ‌"
"3771","isi hadis ki dusri asnaad mazkoor hain."
"3772","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ‌(sl) ne farmaya ‌ : jo barda 2 aadmiyon mein mushtarak ho phir aik Sharik apna hissey aazad kar dewe to wo zaamin hoga doosrey Sharik ke hissey ka (agar maal daar ho ("
"3773","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai Rasulullah ‌(sl) ne farmaya ‌ : jo shakhs apna hissey ghulam main aazad kar de to uska chhudana (yani doosrey hissey ka bhi aazad karna) bhi isi ke maal se hoga agar maaldaar ho, agar maaldaar na ho to ghulam mahnat mazduri karey aur is par jabr na karein  ."
"3774","tarjama dusri riwayat ka bhi wahi hai jo uper guzra us main itna zyada hai ke agar wo aazad karne wala maaldaar na ho to ghulam ki waajibi qeemat lagai jaey aur mahnat karey apne baqi hissey ke liye jo aazad nahi hua magar is par jabr nahi hoga."
"3775","Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne ‌ibne-abi Aruba ki hadis ki manind (tarah) riwayat ki aur hadis mein ye bhi zikr kya ke uski waajibi qeemat lagai jaey."
"3776","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne aik londi khareed kar usey aazad karne ka irada kya. uske maalikon ne kaha : ham is shart par ye kaneez aapko bechengey ke iska haqe-'walaa' hamara hoga. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne is baat ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap ne farmaya : ye ( shart ( tumhen ( usko khareed kar aazad karne se) na rokey (is kaneez ko zaroor aazadi milni chahiye) bila shubah 'walaa' ka haq usi ka hai jisne ( ghulam ya kaneez ko) aazad kya."
"3777","Leis ne hamein ibne-Shahab se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Urwa se riwayat ki, Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein khabar di ke Barira (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas aai. wo unse apni makaatibat ( qeemat ada karke aazaadi ka muaahida karne) ke silsiley mein madad maang rahi thi. us ne apni makaatibat ki raqam mein se kuchh bhi ada nahi kiya tha. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne us se kaha : apne maalikon ke paas jao, agar wo pasand karein ke main tumhari makaatibat (likhai) ki raqam ada karun aur tumhara haq 'walaa' mere liye ho, to main ( tumhari qeemat ki adaaeygi ( kar dun gi. Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye apne maalikon se kahi to unhon-ne inkar kar diya, aur kaha : agar wo tumharey sath neki karna chahti hain to karein, lekin tumhari 'walaa' ka haq hamara hi hoga. is par unhon (Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ( ne ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ki. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse kaha : tum khareed lo aur aazad kar do, kyonke 'walaa' ka haq usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (member par) khadey huey aur farmaya : logon ko kya hua hai? wo aisi shartein rakhtey hain jo Allah ki kitab (ki taalimat ( mein nahi. jisne aisi shart rakhi jo Allah ki kitab mein nahi hai to usey iska koi haq nahi chahey wo sou martaba shart rakh ley. Allah ki shart zyada haq rakhti hai aur wahi zyada mazbut hai."
"3778","Yunus ne mujhey ibne-Shahab se khabar di, unhon-ne Urwa-bin-Zubair se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas aai aur kehney lagi : Aaisha ! maine apne maalikon se nou (9) auqiya par makaatibat ( qeemat ki adaaeygi par aazad ho janey ka muaahida ( kiya hai, har saal mein aik auqiya ( 40 dirham ada karna ( hai, aagey Leis ki hadis ke ham mana hai aur (is mein) ye izafa kiya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tumhen unki ye baat ( Barira ko aazad karne se) na rokey . usey khareedo aur aazad kar do aur) Yunus ne) hadis mein kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein khadey huey, Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya : ammaa ba'd ! (khutba diya jis mein shart wali baat irshad farmai.)."
"3779","abu-Usama ne kaha : hamein Hisham-bin-Urwa ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey mere walid ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas aai aur kehney lagi : mere maalikon ne mere sath nou (9) saalon mein nou (9) auqiya (ki adaaeygi (ke badley makaatibat (aazadi ki baat ( ki hai. har saal mein aik auqiya ( ada karna ( hai. meri madad karein. maine us se kaha : agar tumharey Malik chaahein ke main unhein yak-musht gin dun aur tumhen aazad kar dun aur 'walaa' ka haq mera ho. to main aisa kar loongi. us ne ye baat apne maalikon se ki to unhon-ne (usey man-ney se) inkar kar diya siwaey-iske ke haq 'walaa' unka ho. iske baad wo mere paas aai aur ye baat mujhey batai, kaha : to maine is par barhami ka izhar kiya, aur kaha : Allah ki qism ! phir aisa nahi ho sakta. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye baat suni to mujh se poochha, maine aapko ( poori ( baat batai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usey khareedo aur aazad kar do, unke liye 'walaa' ki shart rakh lo, kyonke (asl mein to) 'walaa' (sarparasti) ka haq usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya. maine aisa hi kiya. kaha : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sham ke waqt khutba diya, Allah ki hamd aur sana jo iske shaayaan shaan thi bayan ki, phir farmaya : ammaa ba'd! logon ko kya hua hai? wo aisi shartein rakhtey hain jo Allah ki kitab mein (jaaiz) nahi. jo bhi shart Allah ki kitab mein (rawaa) nahi, wo baatil hai, chahey wo sou (100) shartein hon, Allah ki kitab hi sabse sachchi aur Allah ki shart sabse mazbut hai. tum mein se kuchh logon ko kya hua hai? unmein se koi kehta hai : falan ko aazad tum karo aur haq 'walaa' mera hoga. ( halanke ( 'walaa' ka haq usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya."
"3780","ibne-Numair , Wakee aur Jarir sab ne Hisham-bin-Urwa se isi sanad ke sath abu-Usama ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat bayan ki, lekin Jarir ki hadis mein hai, kaha is ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu)) ka shauhar ghulam tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ( shadi bar-qaraar rakhney ya na rakhney ke barey mein) ikhtiyar diya to usne khud ko) nikah ki bandish se aazad dekhnaa ( pasand kiya. agar uska shauhar aazad hota to aap usey ye ikhtiyar na detey, aur unki hadis mein ammaa ba'd ! ke alfaz nahi hain. (ye alfaz khutbey ki taraf ishara kartey hain.)"
"3781","Hisham-bin-Urwa ne hamein Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke mamley mein teen faisley huey : uske maalikon ne chaha ke usey bech dein aur uske haq 'walaa' ko (apne liye) mashroot (shart ke saath) kar dein, maine ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko batai to aap ne farmaya : usey khareedo aur aazad kar do, kyonke 'walaa' usi ka haq hai jisne aazad kiya. ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : wo aazad hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ikhtiyar diya, us ne apni zaat (ko aazad rakhney) ka intikhab kiya. (hazrat Aaisha ne) kaha : log is par sadqa kartey they aur wo (us mein se kuchh ( hamein hadiya karti thi, maine ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahi to aap ne farmaya : wo is par sadqa hai aur tum logon ke liye hadiya hai, lihaza usey kha liya karo."
"3782","Simak ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko Ansar ke logon se khareeda , unhon-ne 'walaa' ki shart lagai , to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : 'walaa' (ka haq ( usi ke liye hai jisne ( aazaadi ki) nemat ka ehtimaam kiya. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ikhtiyar diya. jabke uska shauhar ghulam tha. aur us ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko gosht hadiya kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar tum hamarey liye us gosht se ( saalan ( taiyaar kartin ? Hazrat Aaisha ne kaha : ye ( gosht ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu) par sadqa kiya gaya tha to aap ne farmaya : wo uske liye sadqa tha aur hamarey liye hadiya hai."
"3783","hamein Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Abdur-Rehman-bin-Qasim se suna, unhon-ne kaha : maine Qasim se suna, wo Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke unhon-ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko aazad karne ke liye khareednaa chaha to un logon ( maalikon ( ne uski 'walaa' ki shart laga di. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne is baat ka tazkira Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kiya, to aap ne farmaya : usey khareedo aur aazad kar do kyonke 'walaa' usi ke liye hai jisne aazad kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se) gosht ka hadiya bheja gaya to unhon ( ghar walon ( ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha : ye Barira par sadqa kiya gaya hai, aap ne farmaya : wo uske liye sadqa hai aur hamarey liye hadiya hai. aur usey ikhtiyar diya gaya. Abdur-Rehman ne kaha : uska shauhar aazad tha. Shoba ne kaha : maine phir se uske shauhar ke barey mein unse puchha to unhon-ne kaha : main nahi janta (wo aazad tha ya ghulam . shak ke baghair , yaqin ke sath ki gaee riwayat yahi hai ke wo ghulam tha.)"
"3784","Abu-Dawud ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( hamein Shoba ne isi sanad se usi ke ham mana hadis bayan ki."
"3785","Urwa ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ka shauhar ghulam tha."
"3786","Rabee-bin-abu-Abdur-Rehman ne Qasim-bin-Muhammad se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ahliya Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne kaha : Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke mamley mein teen sunnatein ( mutaiyan ( huin : jab wo aazad hui to uske shauhar ke hawale se usey ikhtiyar diya gaya. usey gosht ka hadiya bheja gaya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey to handiya choolhey par thi, aap ne khana talab farmaya to aapko roti aur ghar ke saalanon mein se aik saalan pesh kiya gaya, aap ne farmaya : kya maine aag par chadhi handiya nahi dekhi jis mein gosht tha? ghar walon ne jawab diya : kyon nahi, Allah ke rasool ! wo gosht Barira (Raziallahu anhu) par sadqa kiya gaya tha to hamein achchha na laga ke ham aapko usmein se khilaaein . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faraayaa : wo is par sadqa hai aur uski taraf se hamarey liye hadiya hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi ( Barira (Raziallahu anhu)) ke barey mein farmaya tha : haq 'walaa' usi ke liye hai jisne aazad kiya."
"3787","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne chaha ke aik londi khareed kar aazad karein to uske maalikon ne ( usey bechney se) inkar kiya, siwaey-iske ke haq 'walaa' unka ho. Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahi to aap ne farmaya : ye shart tumhen ( neki se) na rokey , kyonke haq 'walaa' usi ka hai jisne aazad kiya."
"3788","Sulaiman-bin-Bilal ne hamein Abdullah-bin-Dinar se khabar di, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 'walaa' (sarparasti) ko bechney aur hiba (deney,hadiya) karne se mana farmaya, Ibrahim ne kaha : maine Muslim-bin Hajjaj ko ye kehtey huey suna : is hadis mein tamam log Abdullah-bin-Dinar hi par inhisaar (nirbhar) karne waley hain. (sab sanadein unhein par aa kar mil jati hain.)"
"3789","ibne-Uena , Ismail-bin-Jafar , Sufiyan Sory , Shoba , Ubaidullah aur Suhak-bin-Usman sab ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki, siwaey-iske ke Ubaidullah se ( abdul-wahaab ( Saqfi ki riwayat ki hui hadis mein sirf khareed aur farokht ka zikr hai, unhon-ne hiba ka zikr nahi kiya."
"3790","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (meesaaqe-Madina mein) diiyaton ( uqool ( ki adaaeygi qabeeley ki har shaakh par lazim thehraai, phir aap ne likha : kisi musalman ke liye jaaiz nahi ke kisi (aur ( musalman ki ijazat ke baghair iske ( Maula ( ghulam ko apna Maula ( haqe-'walaa' rakhney wala ( bana ley. phir mujhey khabar di gaee ke aap ne, apne saheefey mein, us shakhs par jo ye kaam karey, laanat bheji."
"3791","Suhel ne apne walid ( Saleh samaan ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne apne aazad karne walon ki ijazat ke baghair kisi (doosri ( qaum ki 'walaa' ikhtiyar ki, is par Allah ki aur farishton ki laanat hai. aur (qiyamat ke roz (us se koi sifarish qabool ki jaeygi na fidya."
"3792","Zayda ne Sulaiman (Aamash) se, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne apne aazad karne walon ki ijazat ke baghair kisi (doosri ( qaum ki 'walaa' ikhtiyar ki, is par Allah ki, farishton ki aur sab logon ki laanat hai, aur qiyamat ke din us se koi fidya qabool kya jaeyga na koi sifarish ."
"3793","Sheban ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, albatta unhon-ne kaha : jisne apne aazad karne walon ke siwa , unki ijazat ke baghair kisi aur ke sath mawalat ki."
"3794","Ibrahim Taimi ke walid Yazeed bin Sharik se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein khutba diya aur kaha : jiska guman hai ke hamarey paas kitabullah aur us saheefey ke siwa. kaha : wo saheefa unki talwaar ki niyam se latka hua tha. padhi. koi aur cheez hai jisey ham padhtey hain to wo jhoota hai. usmein ( diyat wghaira ke) oonton ki umrein aur zakhmon (ki diyat ( se mutaalliqa kuchh cheezein ( likhi hui ( hain. aur is mein (ye likha hua hai ke) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Jabale-eir se lekar Jabale-sor tak Madina haram hai, jisne usmein (gumrahi phailaney ki) koi waardat ki ya waardat karne waley kisi shakhs ko panah di to is par Allah ki, farishton ki aur sab logon ki laanat hai, qiyamat ke din Allah Taala us se koi sifarish qabool karega na badla . tamam musalmanon ki panah aik hai. unka adna aadmi bhi kisi ko panah de sakta hai. jisne apne walid ke siwa kisi ki taraf nisbat ki ya (koi ghulam ( apne aazad karne waley maalikon ke siwa kisi aur ka Maula bana, is par Allah ki, farishton ki aur sab logon ki laanat hai, qiyamat ke din Allah Taala us se koi sifarish qabool karega na fidya."
"3795","Ismail bin abi hakeem ne mujhey Saeed bin Marjana se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne kisi momin gardan ( momin ghulam jiski gardan mein ghulaami ka tauq tha) ko aazad kya, Allah Taala us ( aazad kiye janey waale) ke har uzu (khaas ang) ke badley us ( aazad karne waale) ka wahi uzu (khaas ang) aag se aazad farmaeyga ."
"3796","Ali-bin Husain ne Saeed bin Marjana se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jisne kisi momin gardan ko aazad kya to Allah Taala uske har uzu (khaas ang) ke badley us ( aazad karne waale) ke aaza mein se wahi uzu (khaas ang) aag se aazad farmaeyga yahan tak ke uski sharmgah ke badley uski sharmgah ko bhi."
"3797","Umar-bin ( Zainul-Aabedeen ( Ali-bin-Husain (bin-Ali-bin-abi-Talib ( ne Saeed-bin-Marjana se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna : jisne kisi momin ko aazad kiya, Allah Taala uske har uzu  (ang) ke badley (is aazad karne waley ka wahi ( uzu (ang) aag se aazad karega, yahan tak ke uski sharmgah ke badley uski sharmgah ko bhi aazad kar dega."
"3798","Waqid bin-Muhammad ne hamein hadis bayan ki, (kaha : ( mujhey Ali-bin-Husain (bin-Ali-bin-abi-Talib (ke sathi (shagird) Saeed-bin-Marjana ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis musalman ne kisi musalman ko aazad kiya, to Allah Taala uske (aazad kiye janey waale) har uzu (ang) ke badley iske wahi uzu (ang) aag se bacha lega. (Saeed-bin-Marjanane) kaha : jab maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis suni to main nikla aur Ali-bin-Husain ke samney iska tazkira kiya to unhon-ne apna wo ghulam aazad kar diya jis (ko kharidney (ke liye ( Abdullah ( ibne-Jafar ne unhein das hazaar dirham ya aik hazaar Dinar dene ki pesh-kash ! ki thi."
"3799","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein jareed ne Suhel se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid ( Abu-Saleh samaan ( se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi betaa walid ka haq ada nahi kar sakta , siwaey-iske ke usey ghulam paaey , usey khareedey aur aazad kar de. ibne-Abi-Sheba ki riwayat mein : koi betaa apne walid ka ke alfaz hain."
"3800","Wakee , Abdullah-bin-Numair aur abu Ahmed zubairi sab ne Sufiyan se, unhon-ne Suhel se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki aur un sab ne bhi ''koi betaa apne walid ka'' ke alfaz kahey."
"3801","Muhammad-bin-Yahya bin hibban ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mulaamisa aur munaabiza ki khareed-bikri se mana farmaya."
"3802","abu-Zinad ne Aaraj se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3803","Hafs bin Aasim ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3804","Abu-Saleh ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3805","Amr-bin-Dinar ne Ata-bin Mina se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne un ( ata ( ko Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, unhon-ne kaha : 2 qism ki khareed-bikri (yani ( mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana kya gaya hai. mulaamisa ye hai ke donon ( bechney waley aur kharidney waale) mein se har aik baghair sochey (aur ghaur kiye ( apne sathi ke kapdey ko chhuey, aur munaabiza ye hai ke donon mein se har aik apna kapda doosrey ki taraf phainkey aur kisi ne bhi apne sathi ke kapdey ko) jiske sath iske kapdey ka tabadla ho raha hai) na dekha ho. (aur usi se saude ki takmeel ho jaey. ("
"3806","Yunus ne mujhey ibne-Shahab se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Aamir bin Sad-bin-abi-Waqas ne bataya ke Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein 2 qism ki khareed-bikri aur 2 qism ke pahnawon se mana farmaya : saude mein aap ne mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana farmaya, mulaamisa ye hai ke koi aadmi doosrey ke kapdey ko din mein ya raat mein apne hath se chhuey aur uske ilawa usey ulat kar bhi na dekhey aur munaabiza ye hai ke koi aadmi doosrey aadmi ki taraf apna kapda phainkey aur doosra uski taraf apna kapda phainkey aur baghair dekhey aur) baghair haqiqi ( razamandi ke yahi unki Sauda ho."
"3807","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath yahi hadis bayan ki."
"3808","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kankar phenk kar Sauda karne aur dhokey wali Sauda se mana farmaya hai."
"3809","Leis ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne hablul-habla ke saudey se mana farmaya hai."
"3810","Ubaidullah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : ahal jahiliyat oont ke gosht ki hablul-habla tak Sauda kartey they. aur hablul-habla ye hai ke ontni ( maada) bachcha janey , phir wo bachcha jo paida hua hai, haamla ho (uski ya uske gosht ke saudey) to Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein us se mana farma diya."
"3811","Imam Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi kisi ke saudey par Sauda na kare."
"3812","Ubaidullah ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : koi aadmi apne ( musalman ( bhai ke saudey par Sauda na karey aur na apne ( musalman ( bhai ke paigham nikah par paigham bhejey , siwaey-iske ke wo usey ijazat de."
"3813","Ismail bin Jafar ne hamein Alaa se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne apne walid ( Abdur-Rehman ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi musalman kisi musalman ke saudey par saude bazi na kare."
"3814","Ahmed bin Ibrahim Dorqi ne mujhey yahi hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Abdus-Samad ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Alaa aur Suhel se hadis bayan ki, un donon ne apne apney walid ( Abdur-Rehman bin Yaqoob aur Abu-Saleh samaan ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, neez hamein Muhammad-bin-Musanna ne yahi hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abdus-Samad ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Aamash se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Abu-Saleh se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, neez Ubaidullah-bin-Muaz ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein mere walid ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Shoba ne Adii-bin Sabit se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Hazim se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya ke koi aadmi apne ( musalman ( bhai ke kiye gaey saudey par Sauda karey, aur Dorqi ki riwayat mein) (saum akheeh) ki bajaey) ( chhotey se saudey (ke alfaz hain."
"3815","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : saude ke liye qafley ke sath rastey mein (ja kar) mulaqat na ki jaey, na tum mein se koi doosrey ke saudey par Sauda karey, na kharidney ki niyat ke baghair mahz bhaaw badhaney ke liye qeemat lagaao, na koi shehri kisi dehati ke liye Sauda karey aur na tum ontni aur bakri ka doodh roko, jisne unhein iske baad khareed liya to unka doodh dohney ke baad usey 2 baton ka ikhtiyar hai : agar usey wo pasand hai to usey rakh ley aur agar usey na-pasand hai to aik saa khajoor ke sath usey wapas kar de."
"3816","Muaz Anbari ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Adi-bin Sabit se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Hazim se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( tijarati ( qaaflon ko aagey ja kar (unke raston mein) milney se, shehri ko kisi dehati ke liye Sauda karne se, aurat ko apni ( musalman ( behan ki talaaq ka mutalba karne se, mahz bhaw chadhaney ke liye qeemat lagaaney se, janwar ke thanon mein doodh rokney se, aur apne bhai ke kiye gaey saudey par Sauda karne se mana farmaya,"
"3817","ghandar, Wahab bin Jarir aur Abdus-Samad bin Abdul-Waris sab ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne isi sanad ke sath Shoba se riwayat ki hui Muaz ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, ghandar aur Wahab ki hadis main ( majhool ke seedhey ke saath) hai : mana kya gaya hai aur Abdus-Samad ki hadis mein) Maruf ke seedhey ke saath) hai : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya,"
"3818","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( kharidney ke iraadey ke baghair ( bhaw chadhaaney ke liye qeemat lagaaney se mana farmaya,"
"3819","ibne-abi-Zayda , Yahya-bin-Saeed aur) Abdullah ( ibne-Numair , un sab ne Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke bazar mein pahunchne se pahley saman hasil kya jaey. ye ibne-Numair ke alfaz hain aur doosrey donon ne kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( samane-tijarat laney walon ko) rastey mein ja kar milney se mana farmaya,"
"3820","Imam Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Ubaidullah se ibne-Numair ki riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3821","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( rastey mein) ja kar saman tijarat leney se mana farmaya."
"3822","Hushaim ne hamein Hisham se khabar di, unhon-ne Ibne-Sirin se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( rastey mein) ja kar bahar se laey janey waley saman tijarat ko hasil karne se mana farmaya,"
"3823","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey Hisham Qurdosi ne Ibne-Sirin se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : saman tijarat ko rastey mein ja kar hasil na karo. jisne bahar mil kar unse saman khareed liya, to jab uska Malik bazar mein aayega to usey ( Sauda ko bar-qaraar rakhney ya fasakh karne ka ( ikhtiyar hoga."
"3824","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid aur Zuber bin Harab ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne Zohri se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, wo us ( sanad) ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchaatey they, aap ne farmaya : koi shehri kisi dehati ke liye Sauda na kare. Zuhair ne kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke aap ne is baat se mana farmaya ke koi shehri kisi dehati ki taraf se Sauda kare."
"3825","Taaus ke betey ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is baat se mana farmaya ke bahar nikal kar qafley walon se mila jaey aur us se ke koi shehri kisi dehati ki taraf se Sauda kare. (Taaus ne) kaha : maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : aap ke farman : koi shehri dehati ki taraf se (sauda na karey) ka kya mafhoom hai? unhon-ne jawab diya : wo uska dalaal na baney."
"3826","Yahya-bin-Yahya tamimi aur Ahmed bin Yunus ne kaha : hamein abu-Khaseema Zuhair ne hadis sunai, kaha : hamein abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : koi shehri kisi dehati ki taraf se Sauda na kare. logon ko chhod do, Allah Taala unmein se kuchh ko kuchh ke zariey se rizq deta hai. albatta Yahya ki riwayat main ( majhool ke seeghey ke saath (passive voice)) hai : rizq diya jata hai."
"3827","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein abu-Zuhair se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3828","Yunus ne Ibne-Sirin se, unhon-ne Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein mana kya gaya hai ke koi shehri kisi dehati ki taraf se Sauda karey, chahe wo iska bhai ho ya walid ."
"3829","Ibne-Aun ne hamein Muhammad (bin Sirin ( se hadis bayan ki, kaha : Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : hamein is baat se mana kya gaya ke koi shehri kisi dehati ke liye Sauda kare."
"3830","Musa bin Yasar ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne doodh roki gaee bhed (ya bakri ( khareed li to wo usey lekar ghar wapas aaey aur uska doodh nikaley, agar wo uske doodh deney se razi ho to usey rakh ley , warna khajoor ke aik saa samet usey wapas kar de."
"3831","Suhel ke walid ( Abu-Saleh ( ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne aisi bhed (ya bakri ( khareed li jiska doodh roka gaya hai to usey teen din tak iske barey mein ikhtiyar hai, agar chahey to rakh ley aur chahey to wapas kar de aur uske sath khajoor ka aik saa bhi wapas kare."
"3832","Qurra ne hamein Muhammad (bin Sirin ( se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne doodh roki hui bhed (ya bakri ( khareed li to usey teen din tak ikhtiyar hai. agar wo usey wapas karey to iske sath ghalley ka aik saa bhi wapas karey, gandam ka nahi."
"3833","Sufiyan ne hamein Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Muhammad (bin Sirin ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne doodh roki hui bakri khareed li, usey 2 baton ka ikhtiyar hai. agar chahey to usey rakh ley aur agar chahey to usey wapas kar de, aur khajoor ka aik saa bhi wapas kar de, gandam ka nahi."
"3834","abdul-wahaab ne Ayub se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, lekin unhon-ne kaha : jisne ( doodh roki hui ( koi bhed ya bakri khareedi usey ikhtiyar hai."
"3835","Hammam-bin-Munabba se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : ye hadisein hain jo hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, iske baad unhon-ne kai hadisein bayan kin, unmein se aik ye thi : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab tum mein se koi doodh roki gaee ontni ya bhed (ya bakri ( khareed ley to usey iska doodh nikalney ke baad 2 baton ka ikhtiyar hai ya to wo ( janwar ( le-ley warna khajoor ke aik saa samet usey wapas kar de."
"3837","Sufiyan-bin-Uena aur Sufiyan Sory ne Amr-bin-Dinar se isi sanad ke sath usi ke mutabiq riwayat ki."
"3838","Mamar ne ibne- Taaus se khabar di, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne ghalla khareeda to wo usey farokht na karey yahan tak ke usey apne qabzey mein ley ley. Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main har cheez ko ghalley ki tarah samajhta hun."
"3839","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , abu-Kuraib aur Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim ne hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. Ishaq ne kaha : hamein khabar di aur doosrey ne kaha : hamein hadis bayan ki. padhi. Wakee ne Sufiyan se, unhon-ne ibne- Taaus se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo ghalla khareedey to usey aagey farokht na karey yahan tak ke usey maap (kar qabzey mein ley) ley. (Taaus ne kaha :) maine Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : kyon ? unhon-ne jawab diya : kya tum dekhtey nahi ke log soney ke iwaz ( ghalla ( khareedtey hain halanke ghalla muakhkhar hota hai. abu-Kuraib ne apni hadis mein, , muakhkhar hota hai, nahi kaha,"
"3840","Abdullaah-bin-Muslima Qanabi ne hamein hadis sunai, kaha : hamein Malik ne hadis sunai aur Yahya-bin-Yahya ne hamein hadis sunai, kaha : maine Malik ke samney qirat ki ke Naafe se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey to pura hasil karne se pahley usey farokht na kare."
"3841","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne pichhli sanad ke sath Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein ham ghalla khareeda kartey they, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham par aisey aadmi muqarrar farmatey jo hamein hukm detey ke usey farokht karne se pahley us jagah se jahan ham ne usey khareedaa tha, kisi dusri jagah muntaqil karein."
"3843","neez unhon (hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : ham ahale-qaafila se baghair maap (aur wazan) ke ghalla khareedaa kartey they, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein mana farmaya ke ham usey , uski jagah se muntaqil karne se pahley, aagey farokht karein."
"3844","Umar-bin Muhammad ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey to usey pura kar leney aur apne qabzey mein leney se pahley farokht na kare."
"3846","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein agar wo ( wazan aur maap ke baghair ( andaazey se ( dher ki sura mein) ghalla khareedtey aur usko muntaqil karne se pahley usi jagah farokht kartey to is par unko mar padti thi."
"3847","Yunus ne mujhey ibne-Shahab (Zohri ( se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Salim bin-Abdullah ne bataya ke unke walid ( Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein logon ko dekha ke jab wo ( naap-tol ke baghair ( andaazey se ghalla khareedtey to is baat par unhein mar padi thi ke wo usko gharon mein muntaqil karne se pahley , usi jagah usey bechein. ibne-Shahab ne kaha : mujhey Ubaidullah bin-Abdullah-bin-Umar ne hadis bayan ki ke unke walid andaazey se ghalla khareedtey , phir usey apne ghar utha laatey."
"3848","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba, ibne-Numair aur abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein Zaid-bin-Hubab ne Suhak bin Usman se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Bukair bin-Abdullah-bin ashajj se, unhon-ne Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey to usey naap kar leney se pahley aagey farokht na kare. Abu-Bakar ki riwayat main ( من الشترى ( ki bajaey) 'manittaba' (pairvi) ke alfaz hain ( mana aik jaisey hain. ("
"3849","Abdullah-bin-Haaris makhzumi ne hamein khabar di, kaha : hamein Suhak bin Usman ne Bukair bin-Abdullah-bin ashajj se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Marwan se kaha : tum ne soodii tijarat halal kar di hai? Marwan ne jawab diya : maine aisa kya kya hai? Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : tum ne adaaeygi ki dastaawez (chekon) ke saudey halal qarar di hai halanke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mukammal qabza karne se pahley ghalley ko bechney se mana farmaya hai. kaha : is par Marwan ne logon ko khutba diya aur un (chekon) ke saudey se mana kar diya. Sulaiman ne kaha : maine muhaafizon ko dekha wo unhein logon ke hathon se wapas ley rahe they."
"3850","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya kartey they : jab tum ghalla khareedo to usey poori tarah qabzey mein leney se pahley na becho."
"3851","ibne- Wahab ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey ibne-Juraij ne hadis bayan ki ke abu-Zubair ne unhein khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo ke rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ki us dheri ko, jiska maap malum nahi, khajooron ke muaiyan maap ke iwaz bechney se mana farmaya hai."
"3852","Rooh bin Ubada ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne abu-Zubair se khabar di, unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, padhi. usi ( uper zikr ki gaee riwayat ( ki tarah, lekin unhon-ne hadis ke aakhir mein) من التمر (ke alfaz zikr nahi kiye."
"3853","Imam Malik ne Naafe se aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Sauda karne waley donon mein se har aik ko apne sathi ke khilaf (sauda faskh karne ka ( ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon, siwaey-iske ke ikhtiyar wali Sauda ho."
"3854","Ubaidullah, Ayub, Yahya-bin-Saeed aur Suhak ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Naafe se Imam Malik ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3855","Leis ne hamein Naafe se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne farmaya : jab 2 aadmi aapas mein Sauda karein to donon mein se har aik ko) saudaa khatm karne ka ( ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo donon juda na ho jayen aur ikatthey hon. ya un donon mein se aik doosrey ko ikhtiyar de, agar unmein se aik doosrey ko ikhtiyar de aur usi par donon Sauda kar lein to Sauda lazim ho gaya, aur agar aapas mein Sauda karne ke baad donon juda huey aur unmein se kisi ne Sauda ko tark nahi kya to bhi Sauda lazim ho gaya."
"3856","Zuhair-bin-Harab aur ibne-abi-Umar donon ne Sufiyan se riwayat ki. Zuhair ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne ibne-Juraij se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne (hadis) imla karaai ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jab 2 Sauda karne waley aapas mein khareed w farokht karein to unmein se har aik ko apne saude ( ko khatm karne) ka ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo aapas mein juda na hon ya unka Sauda ikhtiyar se hua ho ( unhon-ne ikhtiyar istemal kar liya ho. ( agar unka Sauda ikhtiyar se hua hai to lazim ho gaya hai. ibne-abi-Umar ne apni riwayat mein izafa kya ke Naafe ne kaha : jab wo ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) kisi aadmi se Sauda kartey aur chahtey ke wo aadmi unse saude ki waapsi ka mutalba ( اقالہ ( na karey to wo (khiyaar majlis khatm karne ke liye) uthtey, thoda sa chaltey, phir uske paas wapas aa jatey."
"3857","Abdullah-bin-Dinar se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo keh rahe they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : 2 Sauda karne walon ke darmyan (is waqt tak) Sauda ( lazim ( nahi hota, yahan tak ke wo aik doosrey se juda ho jayen, siwaey-iske ke khiyaar ( ikhtiyar ( wala Sauda ho. (jis mein khiyaar ki muddat tay kar li jaey ya ikhtiyar istemal karke Sauda ko pakka kar liya jaey.)"
"3858","abu-Khaleel ne Abdullah-bin-Haaris se, unhon-ne Hazrat Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, aap ne farmaya : Sauda karne waley donon fareeqon ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak juda na hon. agar wo donon sach bolein aur haqiqat ko waazeh karein to unke saude mein barkat dali jati hai, aur agar wo jhoot bolein aur (aib wghaira) chipaaein to unke saude se barkat mitaa di jati hai."
"3859","Abu-Tayyah se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Abdullah-bin-Haaris se suna, wo Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki. imam Muslim-bin Hajjaj (Rehmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha : Hazrat Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) Kaba ke andar paida huey they aur unhon-ne 120 saal zindagi paai."
"3860","Ismail bin Jafar ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : aik aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke usey saude mein dhoka de diya jata hai. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum jis se bhi Sauda karo to keh diya karo : dhoka nahi hoga. ( iskey baad) wo jab bhi Sauda karta to kehta : dhoka nahi hoga."
"3861","Sufiyan aur Shoba donon ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki, lekin un donon ki hadis mein ye alfaz nahi hain : wo jab saudaa karta to kehta tha : dhokaa nahi hoga."
"3862","Imam Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (is waqt tak darakhton par lagey huey) phalon ke saudey se mana farmaya yahan tak ke unki ( pakney ki) salahiyatein zahir ho jaey. aap ne bechney waley aur kharidney waley donon ko) aisi Sauda se) mana farmaya,"
"3863","Ubaidullah ne hamein Naafe se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3864","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ke saudey se mana farmaya yahan tak ke wo surkh ya zard ho jaey aur khel ( satte) (ke saude) se yahan tak ke wo ( daney bhar kar) safaid aur aafaat se mehfooz ho jaey. aap ne bechney aur kharidney waley donon ko mana farmaya."
"3865","Jarir ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum phal mat khareedo yahan tak ke unki salahiyatein zahir ho jaey aur us se aafat (ka imkan) khatm ho jaey. ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne) kaha : uski salahiyatein (zahir honey) se uski surkhi aur zardi murad hai."
"3866","abdul-Wahab ne Yahya se isi sanad ke sath yahan tak ke uski salahiyatein waazeh ho jaey tak hadis bayan ki, iske baad wala hissey bayan nahi kya."
"3867","ibne-abi Fudaik ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Suhak ne Naafe se khabar di, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se abdul-wahaab ki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3868","Musa-bin-Aqba ne mujhey Naafe se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Imam Malik aur Ubaidullah ki hadis ki tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"3869","Ismail bin Jafar ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum phal na becho yahan tak ke uski salahiyatein zahir ho jaey."
"3870","Sufiyan aur Shoba donon ne Abdullah-bin-Dinar se isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, Shoba ki hadis mein ye izafa hai ke ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha gaya : uski salahiyatein se kya murad hai? unhon-ne kaha is se aafat ( borgar janey aur bimari lag janey (ka waqt khatm ho jaey."
"3871","abu-Zubair ne hamein Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (is waqt tak) darakht par lagey phal ko bechney se mana farmaya, padhi. ya kaha : hamein mana farmaya, padhi. yahan tak ke wo theek ho jaey."
"3872","Amr-bin-Dinar ne hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo keh rahe they : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (is waqt tak) darakht par lagey phal ko bechney se mana farmaya yahan tak ke uski salahiyatein zahir ho jaey."
"3873","abu bakhtri se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se khajoor ke saudey ke barey mein malum kya to unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ke saudey se mana farmaya yahan tak ke wo us se khud kha sakey ya wo khaaey janey ke qaabil ho jaey, aur yahan tak ke iska wazan kya ja sakey. maine kaha : iska wazan kiye janey se kya murad hai? unke paas maujood aik shakhs ne kaha is (ke wazan (ka andaza lagaya ja sakey."
"3874","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( darakhton par laga hua) phal na khareedo yahan tak ke uski salahiyatein zahir ho jaey."
"3875","hamein Yahya-bin-Yahya ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Zohri se khabar di, neez hamein ibne-Numair aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne hadis bayan ki. padhi. alfaz unhi donon ke hain. padhi. donon ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan ne hadis bayan ki ke hamein Zohri ne Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne ( pakney ki) salahiyatein zahir honey se pahley phal ke saudey se aur phal ko khushk khajoor ke iwaz bechney se mana farmaya."
"3876","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : hamein Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sauda araayaa ki ijazat di. ibne-Numair ne apni riwayat mein ye izafa kiya : ( ijazat di (ke usey bechaa (ya khareedaa ( jaey."
"3877","ibne-Shahab se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Saeed-bin-Musaiyab aur abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : phal ( pakney ( ki salahiyatein zahir honey se pahley mat khareedo aur na khushk khajoor ke iwaz ( darakht par laga ( phal khareedo. ibne-Shahab ne kaha : mujhey Saalim-bin-Abdullah-bin-Amr ne apne walid se hadis bayan ki. unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, bilkul usi ki tarah."
"3878","ibne-Shahab ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna aur Muhaaqla ke saudey se mana farmaya, Muzaabna ye hai ke khajoor par lagey phal ko khushk khajoor ke iwaz farokht kiya jaey. aur Muhaaqla ye hai ke kheti ko) katney se pahley) gandam ke iwaz farokht kiya jaey. aur zamin ko gandam ke iwaz kiraaey par diya jaey. (ibne-Shahab ne) kaha : mujhey Saalim-bin-Abdullah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khabar di ke aap ne farmaya : salahiyatein zahir honey se pahley phal na khareedo , aur na (darakht par lagey) phal ko khushk khajoor ke iwaz khareedo . Salim ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke aap ne us ( manaahi ke aam hukm (ke baad ariya ke saudey mein taro-taazaa ya khushk khajoor ke iwaz saudey ki rukhsat (chhut) di, aur uske siwa kisi saudey mein rukhsat nahi di."
"3879","Imam Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ariya waley ko ijazat di ke wo usey (is par maujood phal ko) miqdar ka andaza kartey huey khushk khajoor ke iwaz baich ley."
"3880","Sulaiman-bin-Bilal ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se khabar di kaha : mujhey Naafe ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Hazrat Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ariya ke barey mein rukhsat (chhut) di ( ariya ye hai) ke ghar waley (apni taraf se diye gaey darakht ke phal ka ( khushk khajoor ke hawale se andaza laga kar usey ley lein taake wo taaza khajoor kha sakein."
"3881","abdul-wahaab ne hamein kaha ke maine Yahya-bin-Saeed se suna wo keh rahe they : mujhey Naafe ne isi sanad se usi ki tarah khabar di."
"3882","Hushaim ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se isi sanad ke sath khabar di, albatta unhon-ne kaha : ariya se wo khajoor ka darakht murad hai jo logon ko) bataur Atiya ( diya jata hai. wo ( darakht par lagey phal ko) andaazey ke baqadr khushk khajooron ke iwaz farokht kar detey hain."
"3883","Leis ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se khabar di, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ariya ko (is se hasil honey wali) khushk khajoor ki miqdar ke andaazey se farokht karne ki ijazat di. Yahya ne kaha : ariya ye hai ke koi aadmi apne ghar walon ki khuraak ke liye khajoor ka taaza phal (is se hasil honey wali) khushk khajoor ke andaazey ke iwaz khareed ley. (ye tareef taaza phal leney waley ke nuqta nazar se hai. mafhoom aik hi hai.)"
"3884","Abdullah-bin-Numair ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne araayaa mein rukhsat di ke us (ke phal (ka andaza kartey huey usey khajoor ki maapi hui miqdar ke iwaz farokht kar diya jaey."
"3885","Yahya-bin-Saeed ne Ubaidullah se isi sanad ke sath hadis riwayat ki, aur) farokht kar diya jaey ki bajaey) hasil kar liya jaey ke alfaz bayan kiye."
"3886","Ayub ne Naafe se isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne araayaa ke saudey mein iske andaazey ki miqdar (ke hisab se lein-dein ( ki ijazat di."
"3887","Sulaiman-bin Bilal ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne bushair bin Yasar se, unhon-ne apne gharaaney se talluq rakhney waley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kuchh sahaba se, jin mein Sehal bin abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) bhi shamil hain, riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( darakht par lagey ( phal ko khushk khajoor ke iwaz farokht karne se mana farmaya aur aap ne farmaya : ye sood hai, yahi ( Sauda ( Muzaabna ( khajoor ke darakht par lagey huey phal ko khushk khajoor ke iwaz farokht karna ( hai. haan , albatta aap ne ariya ko bechney ya kharidney ki ijazat di ( ghariya ye hai) ke koi khandan aik 2 khajoor ke darakht (jo bataur Atiya de gaey ( unse hasil honey wali khushk khajoor ke andaazey ke mutabiq ley lein taake wo iska taaza phal khaaein (aur jinhein darakht diye gaey hain, unhein khushk khajoor de dein. ("
"3888","Leis ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se khabar di, unhon-ne Bushair bin Yasar se aur unhon-ne Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke) kuchh ( sahaba se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ariya ko (is se hasil honey wali) khushk khajoor ki miqdar ke andaazey se farokht karne ki ijazat di."
"3889","Muhammad-bin-Musanna , Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim aur ibne-abi-Umar sab ne ( abdul-wahaab ( Saqafi se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Yahya-bin-Saeed se suna wo keh rahe they : mujhey Basheer-bin-Yasar ne apne khandan se talluq rakhney waley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kuchh ashaab se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, aagey Yahya se Sulaiman-bin Bilal ki hadis ( 3887 ( ki tarah hadis zikr ki. lekin Ishaq aur ibne- Musanna ne lafz rabba ki bajaey lafz (zaban) (Muzaabna) istemal kya hai, phir bhi ibne-abi-Umar ne ribaa hi kaha."
"3890","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Basheer-bin-Yasaar se, unhon-ne Sehal bin abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki. unhi ( Sulaiman, Leis aur Saqafi) ki hadis ke ham mana."
"3891","Waleed bin Kasir ne kaha : mujhey banu-Haarisa ke Maula Basheer-bin-Yasaar ne hadis bayan ki ke Rafe-bin-Khadeej aur Sehal bin abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) donon ne usey hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna , yani taaza khajoor ki khushk khajoor ke iwaz Sauda se mana farmaya, siwaey araya walon ke kyonke unhein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ijazat di thi."
"3892","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne kaha : maine Imam Malik se puchha : kya aapko Daawood-bin-Husain ne ibne-abi Ahmed ke aazad karda ghulam Abu-Sufiyan ( Wahab ( se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne araayaa ko panch wasq se kam ya panch wasq tak andaazey se bechney ki rukhsat di hai? . padhi. (Imam Muslim (Rehmatullahi-alaih) Mina ne kaha : ( shak Dawud ko hai ke unhon ( Abu-Sufiyan ( ne panch wasq kaha ya panch wasq se kam kaha, padhi. to unhon (Imam Malik ( ne jawab diya : haan."
"3893","Imam Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna se mana farmaya aur Muzaabna se murad ( khajoor ke taaza ( phal ko khushk khajoor ki maapi (ya toli hui) miqdar ke iwaz aur angoor ko munaqqa ki maapi (ya toli hui) miqdar ke iwaz farokht karna hai."
"3894","Muhammad-bin-Bishr ne kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne Naafe se hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna se mana farmaya, aur Muzaabna ye hai ke khajoor ke taaza phal ko khushk khajoor ki maapi hui miqdar ke iwaz becha jaey aur angoor ko munaqqa ki maapi hui miqdar ke iwaz becha jaey aur) khoshon mein) gandam ki kheti ko maapi hui miqdar ke iwaz bechaa jaey."
"3895","ibne-abi-Zayda ne Ubaidullah se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3896","abu-Usama ne ham se bayan kya, kaha : hamein Ubaidullah ne Naafe se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna se mana farmaya aur Muzaabna ye hai ke khajoor ke (taaza) phal ko khushk khajoor ke maap ki muqarrara miqdar ke badley aur angoor ko munaqqa ke maap ki muqarrara miqdar ke badley farokht kya jaey aur kisi bhi phal ko andaazey ki buniyad par (usi tarah) farokht karne se mana farmaya."
"3897","Ismail bin Ibrahim ne hamein Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna se mana farmaya aur Muzaabna ye hai ke khajoor par jo phal laga hua hai usey maap ki muqarrara miqdar ke sath khushk khajoor ke iwaz becha jaey ke agar badh gaya to mera aur agar kam ho gaya to uski zimme-dari bhi mujh par hogi."
"3898","Hammad ne Ayub se isi sanad ke sath usi ke ham-mana hadis bayan ki."
"3899","Qutaiba-bin-Saeed aur Muhammad-bin Rumeh ne Leis se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna se mana farmaya (Muzaabna ye hai) ke koi aadmi apne baagh ka phal agar khajoor ho to khushk khajoor ke muqarrara maap ke iwaz farokht karey aur agar angoor ho to munaqqa ke muqarrara maap ke iwaz farokht karey aur agar kheti ho to ghalley ke muqarrara maap ke iwaz usey farokht kare. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un sab (saudon) se mana farmaya, Quteba ki riwayat mein aur agar kheti ho ke bajaey"" ya kheti ho ke alfaz hain."""
"3900","Younus, Suhak aur Musa-bin-Aqba sab ne Naafe se isi sanad ke sath un (Ubaidullah, Ayub aur Leis) ki hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"3901","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne kaha : maine Imam Malik ke samney qirat ki, unhon-ne Naafe se aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne khajoor ka aisa darakht farokht kya jis par nar khajoor ka bor daala gaya ho to uska phal farokht karne waley ka hai siwaey-iske ke khareedaar ( Sauda ke doran mein) shart tay kar ley."
"3902","Ubaidullah ne hamein Naafe se hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : khajoor ka jo darakht khareeda gaya aur uski taabeer ki gaee thi to uska phal usi ke liye hai jisne taabeer ki, magar ye ke wo aadmi jisne usey khareeda ( saudey mein uski ( shart tay kar ley."
"3903","Leis ne hamein Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jisne khajoor ki taabeer ( nar khajoor ka bor daal kar uski pardakht) ki phir iske darakht ko bech diya, to khajoor ka phal usi ka hai jisne taabeer ki, siwaey-iske ke kharidney wala shart tay kar ley."
"3904","Ayub ne Naafe se isi sanad ke sath isi tarah riwayat ki."
"3905","Leis ne hamein ibne-Shahab se khabar di, unhon-ne Salim bin-Abdullah-bin umr se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna aap farma rahe they : jisne taabeer kiye janey ke baad khajoor ka darakht khareeda, to uska phal usi ka hai jisne usey becha, siwaey-iske ke khareedaar shart tay kar ley aur jisne ghulam khareedaa to uska maal usi ka hai jisne usey farokht kya, siwaey-iske ke khareedaar shart tay kar ley."
"3906","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki."
"3907","Yunus ne mujhey ibne-Shahab se khabar di, kaha : mujhey Salim bin-Abdullah-bin umr ne hadis bayan ki ke unke walid ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they. usi ki tarah ."
"3908","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein ibne-Juraij se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ata se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muhaaqla , Muzaabna , mukhaahira aur) pakney ki) salahiyatein zahir honey se pahley phalon ke saudey se mana farmaya aur) hukm diya ke) araayaa (ki Sauda (ke siwa ( phal ya kheti ko) sirf Dinar aur dirham ke iwaz hi farokht kiya jaey."
"3909","abu-Aasim ne hamein khabar di, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne ata aur abu-Zubair se khabar di, un donon ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, padhi. aagey usi ki tarah bayan kiya."
"3910","mukhlid-bin-Yazeed-jazri ne hamein khabar di, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Ata ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mukhaahira , Muhaaqla , Muzaabna aur khaney ke qaabil honey se pahley phalon ki farokht karne se mana farmaya. aur (hukm diya ke phalon aur ajnaas ki) sirf dirham aur Dinar hi se Sauda kiya jaey, siwaey araayaa ke. Ata ne kaha : Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne un alfaz ki wazaahat (viyakhiya) kartey huey kaha : mukhaahira se murad wo chatiyal zamin hai jo aik aadmi doosrey ke hawale karey to wo usmein kharch karey, phir wo ( zamin dene wala ( uski paidawar mein se hissey ley. aur unka khayal hai ke Muzaabna se murad khajoor par lagi hui taaza khajoor ki khushk khajoor (ki mutaiyna miqdar (ke iwaz Sauda hai aur Muhaaqla ye hai ke aadmi khadi fasl ko maaptey huey ghalley ke iwaz baich de."
"3911","Zaid-bin-abi-Unaisaa se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : ham se abu-Waleed Makki ne hadis bayan ki jabke wo Ata-bin-abi-Ribah ke paas baithey huey they, unhon ( Zaid ( ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muhaaqla , Muzaabna , mukhaahira aur is baat se mana farmaya hai ke ishqaah se pahley ( darakht par laga hua) khajoor (ka phal ( khareedaa jaey. ishqaah ye hai ke usmein surkhi ya zardi paida ho jaey ya usmein se kuchh khaya ja sakey ( Sara phal eik hi waqt nahi biktaa , kuchh khaney ke qaabil ho jaey to Sauda jaaiz hai.) aur Muhaaqla ye hai ke kheti ke saudey ghalley ki mutaiyan miqdar ( saa , wasq wghaira ya wazan (ke sath ki jaey aur Muzaabna ye hai ke darakht par lagi khajoor ke saudey khushk khajoor ki) maap ya tol ke zariey se) mutaiyan miqdar ke sath ki jaey aur mukhaahira ye hai ke zamin ko) jawaz ki shart poori kiye baghair ( tehai , chothai ya is tarah ke) kisi mutaiyan ( hissey ke iwaz ( batai par) diya jaey. Zaid ne kaha : maine ( sath baithey ( Ata-bin-abi-Ribah (Rehmatullahi-alaih) se puchha : kya aap ne ( bhi) Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis bayan kartey huey sunaa? unhon-ne jawab diya : haan."
"3912","Sulaim-bin-hayyaan ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Saeed-bin-Mina ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna , Muhaaqla , mukhaahira aur rang tabdeel honey ( ishqaah ( se pahley phalon ke saudey se mana farmaya, (Sulaim-bin-hayyaan ne) kaha : maine Saeed se puchha : ishqaah se kya murad hai? unhon-ne kaha : unmein surkhi aur zardi paida ho jaey aur is mein se khaya ja sakey."
"3913","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Ayub ne abu-Zubair aur Saeed-bin-Mina se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muhaaqla , Muzaabna , muaawma , mukhaahira . padhi. un donon ( abu-Zubair aur Saeed ( mein se aik ne kaha : kai saalon ke liye Sauda karna hi muaawma hai. aur istisnaa wali saudey se mana farmaya aur araayaa (ko khushk phal ke iwaz bechney ( ki ijazat di."
"3914","Ismail bin-Ulaih ne hamein Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne abu-Zubair se, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki. padhi. usi ki tarah , albatta unhon-ne ye zikr nahi kiya ke kai saalon ke liye Sauda karna hi muaawma hai."
"3915","ribaah-bin-abi Maruf ne hamein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Ata se suna, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zamin ko) uski apni paidawar ke badley kiraaey par deyne, us (ke phal ( ko kai saalon ke liye bechney aur pakney se pahley phalon ke saudey se mana farmaya."
"3916","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne hamein Matar warraaq se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Ata se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zamin ko kiraaey par deney se mana farmaya."
"3917","Mehdi-bin-Memnon ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Matar warraaq ne Ata se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ki zamin ho to ( behtar hai) wo usey khud kaasht kare. agar wo khud kaasht na karey to apne bhai ko kaasht kaari ke liye de dey."
"3918","Auzai ne Ata se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke kuchh sahaba ke paas zarurat se zayed zameenein thin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jiske paas zarurat se zayed zamin ho wo ya to usey khud kaasht karey ya apne bhai ko udhaar de dey . agar wo nahi maanta to wo apni zamin apne paas rakh ley. (kisi ghair sharaee tareeqey se kiraaey par na de.)"
"3919","Bukair-bin-Akhnas ne Ata se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke zamin ki ujrat ( kiraaya (ya ( uski honey wali paidawar ka ( mutaiyan ( miqdar mein) hissey liya jaey."
"3920","Abdul-Malik ne hamein Ata se hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jiske paas zamin ho, wo usey khud kaasht karey, agar wo usmein kaashtkaari ki istitaat na paaey aur aajiz ho to ( behtar hai) apne kisi musalman bhai ko aariyatan (udhaar) de dey aur uske sath zamin ki ujrat ka mamla na kare."
"3921","Hammam ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : Sulaiman-bin-Musa ne Ata se sawal kiya aur kaha : kya aapko Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jiske paas zamin ho (to behtar hai) wo usey kaasht karey ya apne bhai ko kaashtkaari ke liye de dey aur usey kiraaey par na de? unhon-ne jawab diya : haan."
"3922","Amr (bin-Dinar) ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mukhaahira (ghalat sharton ke sath batai par diye) se mana farmaya."
"3923","Saeed-bin-Mina ne hamein hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jiske paas faaltu zamin ho wo usey khud kaasht karey ya apne bhai ko kaashtkaari ke liye de dey aur usey (istifaadey (fayda uthaney) ke liye) farokht na karo. main (Sulaim-bin-hayyaan) ne Saeed se puchha : usey farokht na karo se kya murad hai? kya aap ki murad kiraaye par deney se thi? unhon-ne jawab diya : haan."
"3924","Zuhair ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : abu-Zubair ne hamein Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein zamin batai par detey aur) baqi saari paidawar mein se hissey ke ilawa ( gahey janey ke baad khoshon mein bach janey wali gandam aur is tarah ki cheezein (pani ki guzargaahon ke ird-gird honey wali paidawar ( wasool kartey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jiske paas zamin ho wo usey khud kaasht karey ya apne kisi bhai ko kaasht kaari ke liye  (aariyatan (udhaar)) de dey warna usey ( khali ( padaa rehney de."
"3925","Hisham-bin-Sad ne mujhey hadis bayan ki ke unhein abu-Zubair Makki ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein tehai ya chothai hissey ke iwaz , naalon (ke kinaron ki paidawar (ke iwaz zamin letey they. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us barey mein) khutba dene ke liye) khadey huey aur farmaya : jiske paas zamin ho to ( behtar hai) wo usey kaasht kare. agar wo khud usey kaasht nahi karta to apne bhai ko aariyatan (udhaar) de dey. agar wo usey apne bhai ko bhi nahi deta to usko apne paas rakh ley."
"3926","abu-Awana ne hamein Sulaiman (Aamash) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Abu-Sufiyan ( Talha-bin-Naafe ( ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they : jiske paas zamin ho to ( behtar hai ke) wo usey hiba (hadiya) karey ya aariyatan (udhaar) de dey."
"3927","Ammar-bin-ruzzaiq ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath yahi hadis bayan ki, albatta unhon-ne kaha : wo usey kaasht karey ya kisi aur aadmi ko kaasht kaari ke liye de dey."
"3928","Bukair ne hadis bayan ki ke unhein Abdullah-bin-Ubai Salma ne Nauman-bin-abi-Ayash se hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zamin ko (mamnooa' (mana kiye hue) tareeqey se) kiraaey par deney se mana farmaya. Bukair ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne hadis bayan ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : ham apni zameenein batai par detey they. phir jab ham ne Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis suni to usey tark kar diya."
"3929","abu-Zubair ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khali zamin ki do ya teen saalon ke liye Sauda karne se mana farmaya."
"3930","Saeed-bin-Mansoor , abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba , Amr Naqid aur Zuhair-bin-Harab ne kaha : hamein Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Humaid Aaraj se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Sulaiman-bin-ateeq se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kai saalon ke saudey se mana farmaya. abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ki riwayat mein hai : phalon ke kai saal ke liye saudey se ( mana farmaya )."
"3931","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jiski zamin ho wo usey khud kaasht karey ya apne bhai ko aariyatan (udhaar) de dey , agar wo nahi maantaa to apni zamin apne paas rakhey. ( ghalat tareeqey se batai par na de. ("
"3932","Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap Muzaabna aur huqool se mana farma rahe they. Hazrat Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Muzaabna se murad ( khajoor par lagey ( phal ki khushk khajoor se Sauda hai aur haqool se murad zamin ko) uski paidawar ke mutaiyan hissey ke iwaz ( batai par dena hai."
"3933","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muhaaqla aur Muzaabna se mana farmaya."
"3934","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna aur Muhaaqla se mana farmaya, Muzaabna darakht par lagi khajoor ko) khushk khajoor ke iwaz ( khareednaa hai aur Muhaaqla se murad zamin ko kiraaey par dena hai."
"3935","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne hamein Amr (bin-Dinar ( se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : ham mukhaabira mein koi harj nahi samajhtey they yahan tak ke wo pahlaa saal aaya jis mein) Yazeed ki imaarat ke liye bait li gai) to Hazrat Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) ne khayal kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya hai."
"3936","Sufiyan (bin-Uena ), Ayub aur Sufiyan ( Sory ( sab ne Amr-bin-Dinar se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki aur ibne-Uena ki hadis mein ye izafa kiya : to ham ne un ( Raafe (Raziallahu anhu)) ki wjah se ( ehtiyaatan ( usey chhod diya."
"3937","Mujahid se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamari zamin ka fayda ham se rok diya."
"3938","Yazeed-bin-Zaree ne hamein Ayub se khabar di aur unhon-ne Naafe se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar , umr aur Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke doure-imaarat mein aur Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat ke shuruati dinon tak Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) apni zaminon ko batai par detey they yahan tak ke Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat ke aakhiri dinon mein unhein ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) iske barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se manaahi bayan kartey hain, chunanche wo unke paas gaey, mein bhi unke sath tha, unhon-ne unse malum kiya to unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zaminon ko batai par deney se mana farmatey they. iske baad ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey chhod diya. iskey baad jab Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se iske barey mein puchha jata to wo kehtey : Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ka khayal hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya hai."
"3939","Hammad-bin-Zaid aur Ismail ( ibne-Ulaih ( donon ne Ayub se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki aur ibne-Ulaih ki hadis mein ye izafa hai, kaha : iske baad Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey chhod diya aur wo usey (apni zamin ko) kiraaey par nahi detey they."
"3940","Ubaidullah ne hamein Naafe se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : main Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf gaya yahan tak wo unke paas balaat ke maqam par pahunchey to unhon-ne unhein ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko) bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zaminon ko kiraaey par deney se mana farmaya tha."
"3941","Hakam ne Naafe se aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke wo Hazrat Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey. padhi. phir (unke hawale se) yahi hadis Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kartey huey bayan ki."
"3942","Husain-bin-Hasan-bin-Yasar ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Ibne-Aun ne Naafe se hadis bayan ki ke Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) zamin ko ujrat par detey they, kaha : unhein Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ke hawale se hadis batai gaee, kaha : wo mere sath unke yahaan gaey to unhon-ne apne kuchh chachaon se bayan kiya. unhon-ne is hadis mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kiya ke aap ne zamin ko kiraaey par deney se mana farmaya hai. kaha : to Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey chhod diya aur zamin ujrat par na di."
"3943","Yazid-bin-Harun ne kaha : hamein Ibne-Aun ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki aur kaha : unhon-ne apne kuchh chachaon ke waastey se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis bayan ki."
"3944","Saalim-bin-Abdullah ne khabar di ke Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) apni zameenein kiraaey par detey they yahan tak ke unhein ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) zamin ko kiraaey par deney se mana kartey hain. chunanche Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse mulaqat ki aur kaha : ibne-khadeej ! aap zamin ko kiraaey par dene ke barey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya bayan kartey hain? Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha : maine apne do chachaon se suna aur wo donon badr mein Sharik huey they. wo apne gharaaney ke logon ko hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zamin ko batai par deney se mana farmaya hai. Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein ba-khoobi janta tha ke zamin kiraaey par di jati thi. phir Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko khof hua ke (mumkin hai) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske barey mein koi nayaa hukm jari kiya ho jiska unhein ilm na hua ho. lihaza unhon-ne zamin ko kiraaey par dena chhod diya."
"3945","Ismail-bin-Ulaih ne hamein Ayub se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Yala-bin-Hakim se, unhon-ne Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein ham zamin ko uski paidawar ke hissey par detey they aur usey tehai aur chothai hissey aur (iske saath) mutaiyan miqdar mein ghalley ke iwaz kiraaey par detey. aik roz hamarey paas mere chachaon mein se aik aadmi aaya aur kehney laga : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein aik aisey kaam se mana kiya hai jo hamarey liye nafa mand tha lekin Allah aur uske rasool ki itaat hamarey liye zyada nafa bakhsh hai. aap ne hamein mana kiya hai ke ham zamin ko batai par dein aur usey tehai aur chothai hissey aur mutaiyan ghalley ke iwaz kiraaey par dein. aur aap ne zamin ke Malik ko hukm diya ke wo khud usmein kaasht karey ya kaasht ke liye (apne musalman bhai ko) de dey aur aap ne iske kiraaey par deine aur uske siwa ( ghalley ke aik mutaiyan hissey par deine) ko na-pasand kiya hai."
"3946","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne hamein Ayub se khabar di, unhon-ne kaha : Yala-bin-Hakim ne meri taraf likha , unhon-ne kaha : maine Sulaiman-bin-Yasar se suna, wo Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they. unhon-ne kaha : ham zamin ko batai par detey aur usey tehai aur chothai hissey par kiraaey par detey they. aagey ibne-Ulaih ki (pichhli ( hadis ki tarah bayan kiya."
"3947","ibne-abi-Aruba ne Yala-bin-Hakim se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"3948","Jareer-bin-Haazim ne Yala-bin-Hakim ki isi sanad ke sath riwayat ki, unhon-ne ( Sulaiman ke waastey se) Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, unhon-ne (apne chachaon mein se aik (ke alfaz nahi kahey."
"3949","abu-Amr Auzai ne mujhey Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Najaashi se hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne Hazrat Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki Zuhair-bin-Raafe unke chacha they, kaha : Zuher (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas aaey to unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aisey kaam se mana farmaya hai jo hamein sahoolat dene wala tha. maine puchha : wo kya hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo farmaya wo bar-haq hai. kaha : aap ne mujh se puchha : tum apne kheton ka kya mamla kartey ho? maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool ! ham unhein chhoti nehar (ke kinaron ki paidawar ( par ya khajoor ya jau ke (mutaiyena) wasqon par ujrat par detey hain. aap ne farmaya : to aisa na karo, usey khud kaasht karo ya kaasht ke liye kisi ko de do ya waisey hi apne hath mein rakho."
"3950","Ikrima-bin-Ammar ne abu-Najaashi se, unhon-ne Hazrat Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis riwayat ki aur unhon-ne apne chacha Zuher (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ka tazkira nahi kiya."
"3951","Imam Malik ne Rabee-bin-abi-Abdur-Rehman se aur unhon-ne Hanzala-bin-Qais se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se zamin ko kiraaey par dene ke barey mein malum kiya to unhon-ne kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zamin ko kiraaey par deney se mana farmaya hai. kaha : maine puchha : kya soney aur chandi ke iwaz bhi ? unhon-ne jawab diya : albatta soney aur chandi ke iwaz dene mein koi harj nahi."
"3952","Auzai ne hamein Rabeea-bin-abi-Abdur-Rehman se hadis bayan ki, kaha : mujhey Hanzala-bin-Qais Ansari ne hadis sunai, unhon-ne kaha : maine Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se soney aur chandi ( Dinar aur dirham (ke iwaz zamin ko batai par dene ke barey mein sawal kiya to unhon-ne kaha : usmein koi harj nahi. (baat hona ye hai ke) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein log nehron ki zamin , chhotey naalon ke kinaron ki zamin aur) mutaiyan miqdar mein) fasl ki kuchh cheezon ke iwaz zamin ujrat par detey they. kabhi ye ( hissey ( tabah ho jata aur wo mehfooz rehta aur kabhi ye mehfooz rehta aur wo tabah ho jata. logon mein batai ( kiraaey par deine ( ki sirf yahi sura thi. isi liye us se mana kiya gaya. albatta malum aur mehfooz cheez jiski adaaeygi ki zamaanat di ja sakti ho to usmein koi harj nahi."
"3953","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne hamein Yahya-bin-Saeed se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hanzala zurqi se riwayat ki ke unhon-ne Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo keh rahe they : Ansar mein sabse zyada hamarey khet they. kaha : ham zamin ko is shart par kiraaey par detey ke ye ( hissey ( hamarey liye hai aur wo ( hissey ( unke liye hai. kabhi-kabhi is hissey mein paidawar hoti aur is mein na hoti, to aap ne hamein is se mana kar diya. albatta aap ne hamein chandi ke iwaz deney se mana nahi kiya."
"3954","Hammad aur Yazid-bin-Harun ne Yahya-bin-Saeed se isi sanad ke sath usi ke ham-mana hadis bayan ki."
"3955","Yahya-bin-Yahya ne kaha : hamein abdul-Wahid bin Ziyad ne khabar di, neez abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba ne kaha : hamein Ali-bin-Mus-hir ne hadis bayan ki, un donon ( abdul-Wahid aur Ali ( ne ( Sulaiman ( Shebani se aur unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Saaib se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : maine Abdullah-bin Maaqil se muzaar'at ( zamin ki paidawar ki mutaiyan miqdar par batai (ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha : mujhey Hazrat Sabit bin Suhak (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muzaar'at se mana farmaya, ibne-Abi-Sheba ki riwayat mein hai : aap ne us se mana farmaya aur unhon-ne kaha : maine ibne- Maaqil se poochha. Abdullah ka naam nahi liya."
"3956","abu-Awana ne hamein Sulaiman Shebani se khabar di, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin Saaib se riwayat ki, unhon-ne kaha : ham Abdullah-bin Maaqil ke paas gaey, ham ne unse muzaar'at ke barey mein sawal kya to unhon-ne kaha : Hazrat Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ka khayal hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muzaar'at se mana farmaya aur naqdi ke iwaz kiraaey par dene ka hukm diya hai aur farmaya : usmein koi harj nahi."
"3957","Hammad-bin-Zaid ne hamein Amr (bin Dinar ( se khabar di ke Mujahid ne Taaus se kaha : hamarey sath Hazrat Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ke betey ke paas chalo aur unse unke walid ke waastey se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki hui hadis suno, kaha : unhon (Taaus ( ne unhein daanta aur kaha : Allah ki qism : agar mujhey ilm hota ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya hai to main ye kaam (kabhi) na karta lekin mujhey us shakhs ne hadis bayan ki jo usey un sabse zyada jaanney wala hai, unki murad Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi apni zamin apne bhai ko aariyatan de, ye uske liye us se behtar hai ke is par mutaiyan paidawar wsool kare. (is se Allah ki raza bhi hasil hogi aur jhagdon se mehfooz bhi rahega. ("
"3958","Sufiyan ne hamein Amr aur ibne-Taaus se hadis bayan ki aur unhon-ne Taaus se riwayat ki ke wo (naqdi ke iwaz) batai par zamin detey they. Amr ne kaha : maine unse kaha : abu Abdur-Rehman ! agar aap mukhaahira chhod dein (to behtar hai) kyonke log samajhtey hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mukhaahira se mana farmaya hai. unhon-ne kaha : Amr ! mujhey is masley ko un sab ki nisbat zyada jaanney waale, yani Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana nahi farmaya, aap ne to sirf farmaya tha : tum mein se koi apne bhai ko) zamin ( aariyatan de ye uske liye uski nisbat behtar hai ke is par mutaiyan paidawar wsool kare. (bila iwaz deney se usey ghair mutaiyan, wasee nafa hasil hoga)"
"3959","Ayub, Sufiyan, ibne-Juraij aur Shoba sab ne Amr-bin-Dinar se, unhon-ne Taaus se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unki hadis ki tarah bayan kya."
"3960","Mamar ne ibne-Taaus se, unhon-ne apne walid se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : tum mein se koi apni zamin apne bhai ko de ye uske liye us se behtar hai ke is par itna itna, yani mutaiyan miqdar mein wsool kare. kaha : Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : yahi haql hai aur Ansar ki zaban mein Muhaaqla hai."
"3961","Abdul-Malik bin Zaid ne Taaus se, unhon-ne Hazrat Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, aap ne farmaya : jiski zamin ho, wo agar usey apne bhai ko aariyatan de dey to ye uske liye behtar hai."